- LenisProvider: Initializes Lenis smooth scrolling.

CUSTOM HOOKS
- useLenis: Instantiates Lenis with smooth settings (duration 1.2, vertical orientation, smoothWheel: true) and cleans up on unmount.
- usePrefersReducedMotion: Listens to media query (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) to toggle animations.
- useScrollProgress: Computes current page scroll percentage dynamically with a passive scroll listener.

