- `pointer-events: none`, `z-index: 9999`, `opacity: 0.055`, `mix-blend-mode: overlay`
- Background: inline SVG `feTurbulence` filter — `type="fractalNoise"`, `baseFrequency="0.85"`, `numOctaves="3"`, `stitchTiles="stitch"` — creates a fine-grain matte paper texture

**Page Wrapper (`.page-wrapper`):**
- `width: 100%` (scroll snapping lives on `html`, not here)

**All Sections (`.page-section`):**
- `scroll-snap-align: start`
- `scroll-snap-stop: always`
- `height: 100vh`, `min-height: 100vh`, `max-height: 100vh`
- `padding: 3rem 4rem 3.5rem 4rem`
- `box-sizing: border-box`
- `display: flex`, `flex-direction: column`, `justify-content: space-between`
- `position: relative`, `overflow: hidden`
- `background-size: cover`, `background-repeat: no-repeat`

