## FILE STRUCTURE

```
project-root/
├── index.html        ← All semantic HTML, section IDs, animation classes
├── style.css         ← All CSS: variables, reset, sections, animations, media queries
├── main.js           ← Intersection Observer scroll animation logic
└── package.json      ← Vite dev/build scripts ("dev": "vite", "build": "vite build")
```

**Dependencies:** `vite ^5.2.0` (devDependency only — no frontend frameworks)

