## Responsive Breakpoints & Grids

*   **1024px Breakpoint**:
    *   Process cards rearrange from a single horizontal row into a **2x2 grid**, using media queries to reset vertical and horizontal border dividers dynamically.
*   **768px Breakpoint (Mobile & Tablet)**:
    *   Navigation list (`00 INDEX`, `01 ABOUT`, `02 WORK`) in the header is hidden for cleanliness.
    *   Vertical grid lines container (`.grid-background-container`) is hidden.
    *   Hero section min-height resets to `auto` with `40px 0` padding. The layout container collapses from grid to flex column with standard column gaps. Subtitle text `white-space` shifts to `normal` for wrapping.
    *   About split cards stack vertically. Cream box min-height is reset, and black box left border is removed and replaced with a top border.
    *   Work cards stack vertically, spanning the full width of the container.
    *   Process cards stack vertically, converting vertical border dividers to bottom border dividers.
    *   Services columns stack vertically. Left info column padding resets. Right list column left-border is removed and replaced with a top border, and accordion item left-padding is reset.
    *   Contact header columns stack vertically. CTA bar text size reduces to `1.5rem` and arrow box reduces to `48px`. Metadata sub-bar displays stacked.
    *   Footer main layout collapses into a single column, displaying stacked link lists and sub-bars.',
