## Page Layout & Section Order

### 1. Site Header
*   Positioned absolutely at the top of the body (`z-index: 5`), spanning 100% width with generous horizontal padding.
*   **Logo**: "NOCTA" on the left (white, uppercase, bold, letter-spacing: 0.1em).
*   **Navigation Menu**: Centered links separated by literal `/` characters. Links: HOME (active), STUDIO, PROJECTS, CONTACT. Links are uppercase, small, and fade between gray and white on hover.
*   **Action Button**: "GET IN TOUCH" styled with small corner brackets.

### 2. Section 1: Hero
*   Takes up full viewport height (`min-height: 100vh`), centering content vertically and horizontally.
*   **Hero Content**:
    *   Top badge: "2 SLOTS OPEN" (with 7 bars, 3 active).
    *   Heading: Massive h1 text. Left-aligned on the container but centered in the viewport. Split into two lines: "A Studio Built For" (white) and "Ambitious Founders." (steel gray).
    *   Description: Centered paragraph explaining the studio services, max-width around 520px.
    *   CTA Buttons: Flex row of two large buttons: "GET IN TOUCH ↗" and "SEE PRICING ↗", both enclosed in corner brackets. The arrow rotates/slides up-right on hover.
*   **Hero Footer**:
    *   Positioned absolutely at the bottom of the hero section.
    *   Left side: 5-star rating system using SVG star icons (filled with accent `#ff5b35`), labeled with "4.9/5 stars (100+Clients)" and secondary slogan "THEY HIT THEIR TARGETS — YOU''RE NEXT."
    *   Right side: "Scroll to explore" text with a small downward-pointing arrow enclosed in a bracketed square box. The arrow bounces gently.

### 3. Section 2: How It Works (Process)
*   Two-column grid layout (1fr to 1.25fr split) with a solid `#030303` background.
*   **Left Column**:
    *   Top badge: "PROCESS" (with 6 bars, 3 active).
    *   Section heading: "How it works." (large, white, bold).
    *   Section description: Max-width 420px, light gray text.
    *   Tech Stack Widget: Labeled "OUR TECH STACK". Features a row of 7 small square empty slots, each styled with its own set of corner brackets. Slots expand slightly on hover.
*   **Right Column**:
    *   Contains the steps box (`.steps-box`), which features outer corner brackets and a very thin outline border.
    *   Inside the box are 3 vertical steps separated by thin dividers:
        *   **Step 1**: Labeled `/001/` on the left, with 3 vertical indicator bars on the right (1 active). Title: "Brief". Description: "We start with a call to understand your business...".
        *   **Step 2**: Labeled `/002/` on the left, with 3 indicator bars on the right (2 active). Title: "Design". Description: "We design and build your brand and site...".
        *   **Step 3**: Labeled `/003/` on the left, with 3 active indicator bars on the right. Title: "Launch". Description: "We ship, test and hand over a site...".

### 4. Section 3: Case Studies (Projects)
*   Solid `#030303` background.
*   **Section Header**:
    *   Left side: Badge "PROJECTS" (6 bars, 5 active) and heading "Case studies.".
    *   Right side: Left-aligned subheading block: "A selection of recent work showcasing quality, clarity, and real-world application."
*   **Projects Grid**:
    *   Two-column grid of equal size cards.
    *   **Project Cards**: Relative container cards with an aspect ratio of `1.45`, wrapped in thin outlines and outer corner brackets. The background features a full-cover project mockup image that zooms/brightens on hover.
    *   **Card Overlay Content**:
        *   Top Left: Category label (e.g. `/001/`).
        *   Top Right: Project tag badge (e.g. `DEVELOPMENT` or `FULL PACKAGE`).
            *   *Card 1 (Norden)* uses custom bracketed transparent badges.
            *   *Card 2 (Verve)* uses solid filled dark rectangular badges (`#0c0c0e`) without brackets.
        *   Bottom Left: Project title ("Norden" / "Verve") in bold white text.
        *   Bottom Right: Arrow box `↗` styled with corner brackets, which glows and translates up-right on card hover.

### 5. Section 4: Why Choose Us (Benefits)
*   Solid `#030303` background.
*   **Section Header**:
    *   Left side: Badge "BENEFITS" (6 bars, 5 active) and heading "Why choose us.".
    *   Right side: Left-aligned subheading block: "A studio approach to brand and web...".
*   **Benefits Grid**:
    *   A single row divided into 3 equal columns inside a container box (`.benefits-box`) wrapped in outer corner brackets and thin outlines. Columns are separated by thin vertical dividers.
    *   **Column 1 (Senior craft)**:
        *   Visual: Stack of 3 vertical badges: "Senior Designer", "Senior Developer", and "Framer Expert". Each badge is relative, has light background overlays, and features individual corner brackets.
        *   Text: Title "Senior craft" and paragraph description.
    *   **Column 2 (Revenue-focused design)**:
        *   Visual: An ascending bar chart consisting of 12 columns of small white square blocks/dots (drawn cleanly via responsive inline SVG).
        *   Text: Title "Revenue-focused design" and paragraph description.
    *   **Column 3 (Technical excellence)**:
        *   Visual: Three circular gauges side-by-side displaying score text: `99` (Performance), `100` (Accessibility), and `100` (SEO). Labeled beneath.
        *   Text: Title "Technical excellence" and paragraph description.

### 6. Section 5: Footer
*   Solid `#030303` background with a thin top border separator.
*   **Footer Top**:
    *   Three-column grid layout (1.4fr to 1fr to 1fr split).
    *   **Left Column (Newsletter & Socials)**:
        *   "SUBSCRIBE TO OUR NEWSLETTER." text.
        *   A custom bracketed form field with a text input ("Your Email") and a submit button (`↗`) featuring its own brackets.
