    *   **Brand Text**: Massive, blocky, ultra-bold "NOCTA" text stretched centered across the bottom of the viewport in a dark gray color (`#111113`).
    *   **Copyright Row**: Spaced out row at the absolute bottom containing:
        *   Left side: "©2026 NOCTA. DESIGNED BY MARSO".

