## Global Styles
- **Background**: `#0c0c0c` on html, body, and all structural wrappers.
- **Text Color**: `#ffffff` (primary white) and various levels of gray (`#7f7f7f`, `#555555`, `#4a4a4a`, `#383838`) to create visual hierarchy.
- **Font Family**: Primary font is `''Inter'', sans-serif`. Monospaced text uses `''Roboto Mono'', monospace`.
- **Global Reset**:
  ```css
  * {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
