---

## Layout Structure
The page is composed of a fixed header and a scrollable `<main class="main-content">` containing four distinct sections:
1. **Header & Navigation**
2. **Section 1: Hero / Intro Section** (`.hero-container`)
3. **Section 2: Experience Section** (`.experience-section`)
4. **Section 3: Services and Capabilities** (`.services-section`)
5. **Section 4: Let''s Connect & Footer** (`.connect-section`)

---

## Detailed Sections

### 1. Header & Navigation
- **Layout**: Absolute positioned at top of viewport, flex row spanning full width with `justify-content: space-between`, aligned center.
- **Padding**: `48px 80px`.
- **Logo**: "Johnny Quattro" text logo on left. Style: `font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #ffffff`.
- **Nav Links**: Three links -- "Work", "About", "Contact" -- spaced with `gap: 32px`. Style: `font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; opacity: 0.85; transition: opacity 0.2s ease`. Hover: `opacity: 1`.

### 2. Hero / Intro Section (`.hero-container`)
- **Layout**: Flexbox column container with `justify-content: space-between`, `min-height: calc(100vh - 240px)`, and `margin-bottom: 120px`. It fills the first screen fold.
- **Profile Row (`.profile-section`)**:
  - Flexbox container with `align-items: flex-start`, `gap: 24px`.
  - **Avatar**: Circle wrapper (`width: 72px; height: 72px; border-radius: 50%; overflow: hidden; flex-shrink: 0;`). Image is cropped to fit circle (`object-fit: cover`).
  - **Intro Text**: Monospace paragraph using `font-family: ''Roboto Mono'', monospace`. Color is medium-dark gray (`#555555`). Style: `font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.65; letter-spacing: -0.015em`.
    ```html
    I Connect with creators and builders<br>
    to design and develop Framer websites<br>
    reaching goals and delivering the message
    ```
- **Hero Title (`.hero-section`)**:
  - Contains a massive `<h1>` title:
    ```html
    Website Designer<br>
    <span class="and-word">and</span> Brand Strategist
    ```
  - **Styles**: `font-size: clamp(3rem, 7.8vw, 8.5rem); font-weight: 700; line-height: 0.94; letter-spacing: -0.045em; color: #ffffff; margin: 0;`.
  - **Contrast Word (`.and-word`)**: The word "and" is colored in dark charcoal gray (`#383838`).

### 3. Experience Section (`.experience-section`)
- **Layout**: Spaced from hero fold using `margin-top: 120px`. Divided by a top border: `border-top: 1px solid #1c1c1c; padding-top: 80px`. Contains:
  - **Experience Heading**:
    ```html
    <h2 class="experience-heading">
      I have <span class="white-text">11 years of experience</span> running successful design practices together with startups and top brands.
    </h2>
    ```
    Styles: `font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.2vw, 3.8rem); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.035em; color: #7f7f7f; max-width: 900px`. The text "11 years of experience" is colored white (`#ffffff`).
  - **Grid Body (`.experience-body`)**: Grid layout splitting into two columns: `grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr; gap: 80px; align-items: end`.
    - **Left Column (`.links-column`)**: Aligned to bottom-left. Stacks two links vertically: "Download CV" and "Connect with Linkedin". Style: `font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s ease`. Hover: `opacity: 0.8`.
    - **Right Column (`.list-column`)**: Renders a vertical list/table of company items:
      - **Timeline List**: Separated by horizontal rules (`1px solid #1c1c1c`).
      - **Timeline Item (`.experience-item`)**: Grid layout: `grid-template-columns: 60px 180px 1fr 140px; align-items: center; padding: 32px 0`.
        1. *Logo Column*: A blank placeholder `div` with `width: 40px; height: 40px`.
        2. *Company Column*: White text (`#ffffff`), bold, size `19px`.
        3. *Role Column*: Gray text (`#7f7f7f`), regular, size `16px`.
        4. *Duration Column*: Dark gray text (`#4a4a4a`), right-aligned, size `16px`.
      - **Timeline Data**:
        - Quattro Inc. | Founder | 2011 &rarr; Now
        - Google | Design Lead | 2011 &rarr; 2016
        - Meta | Product Designer | 2016 &rarr; 2019\ (literal backslash at end)
        - PayPal | Senior Designer | 2019 &rarr; 2024
        - Hanzo Co. | Founder | 2011 &rarr; Now

### 4. Services and Capabilities (`.services-section`)
- **Layout**: Separated from timeline with `margin-top: 120px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 40px`.
- **Header Line (`.services-header-container`)**:
  - Flex container with heading: `Services <span class="dimmed">and Capabilities</span>` (where "Services" is white, "and Capabilities" is gray `#7f7f7f`).
  - Heading size: `clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 3.2rem); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.03em`.
  - A thin horizontal rule `div` (`.services-header-line`) grows to fill the remaining horizontal space (`flex-grow: 1; height: 1px; background-color: #1c1c1c`).
- **Services Grid (`.services-grid`)**:
  - Grid with 4 columns: `grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr)`.
  - Uses the **grid-line border technique**: container has background color `#1c1c1c`, grid elements have background `#0c0c0c` and are separated by a `1px gap`. The container has `border-top` and `border-bottom` of `1px solid #1c1c1c`.
- **Service Card (`.service-card`)**:
  - Padding: `48px 32px`. Flexbox vertical column layout with `justify-content: space-between; min-height: 480px`.
  - **Top Row (`.card-top`)**: Flex container containing:
    - *Tags (`.card-tags`)*: Stacked vertically with `gap: 6px`. Each tag is a small pill (`background-color: #161616; color: #6f6f6f; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 20px; font-family: ''Roboto Mono'', monospace`).
    - *Card Number (`.card-number`)*: Low-contrast number in bottom-right corner of card top (`font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #161616; line-height: 0.8; letter-spacing: -0.04em`).
  - **Bottom Row (`.card-bottom`)**: Flex column container with `gap: 16px` containing:
    - *Title (`.service-title`)*: White text (`#ffffff`), bold, size `24px`.
    - *Description (`.service-text`)*: Gray text (`#555555`), size `14.5px`, line-height `1.6`.
  - **Cards Data**:
    1. **Web Design** (Number `01`): Tags: `4,000+` and `1 - 3w`. Text: "We''ll find the best visual way to export your story into a fine digital experience"
    2. **Framer Development** (Number `02`): Tags: `3,000+` and `1 - 3w`. Text: "Your website is built, optimized, ran by CMS, and one click away from being published"
    3. **Figma to Framer** (Number `03`): Tags: `1,500+` and `< 1w`. Text: "Let''s add dynamics to your static figma file. It''s live, editable, looks good on any device"
    4. **Content Strategy** (Number `04`): Tags: `2,000+` and `2 - 3w`. Text: "A process to structure and construct your story to make it rank on search engines"

### 5. Let''s Connect & Footer (`.connect-section`)
- **Layout**: Separated from services using `margin-top: 140px; display: flex; flex-direction: column`.
- **Heading (`.connect-heading`)**:
  - Text: `Let''s <span class="white-text">Connect</span>` ("Let''s" is gray `#6f6f6f`, "Connect" is white).
  - Styles: `font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 7.5rem); font-weight: 700; line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: -0.04em; margin: 0 0 40px 0`.
- **Intro Paragraph (`.connect-intro`)**:
  - Text: "Feel free to contact me if having any questions. / I''m available for new projects or just for chatting."
  - Styles: `font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; color: #6f6f6f; margin: 0 0 60px 0; letter-spacing: -0.015em`.
- **Button Grid (`.connect-buttons-grid`)**:
  - Grid with 3 columns: `grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr)`.
  - Height of buttons: `96px`. Text centered horizontally and vertically, size `16.5px`, font-weight 600, uppercase, white color.
  - Buttons use distinct shades of gray:
    - **Book a Call** (`.book-btn`): Background `#141414`. Hover: `#1a1a1a`.
    - **Send an Email** (`.email-btn`): Background `#1d1d1d`. Hover: `#242424`.
    - **Follow on X** (`.x-btn`): Background `#383838`. Hover: `#404040`.
- **Footer (`.footer`)**:
  - Separated from the buttons using `margin-top: 120px` (or container bottom boundary). Divided by top border: `border-top: 1px solid #1c1c1c; padding: 40px 0; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center`.
  - **Left Side (`.footer-left`)**: "Quattro, 2024" in monospaced Roboto Mono. Size `12px`, color `#4a4a4a`.
  - **Right Side (`.footer-right`)**: Flex row of three social SVG icons (X, LinkedIn, Instagram). SVG size: `16px x 16px`, color `#4a4a4a`. Hover: color transitions to `#ffffff` and moves up slightly (`transform: translateY(-1px)`).

---

## Responsive Breakpoints
All sizing is mobile-first, adapting gracefully down to narrow screens:
- **1024px and down**:
  - Header padding decreases to `40px 60px`. Main content padding is `140px 60px 80px 60px`.
  - Services grid transitions to `grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr)`.
- **768px and down**:
  - Header padding decreases to `32px 40px`. Main content padding is `120px 40px 80px 40px`.
  - Profile section becomes vertical (`flex-direction: column`).
  - Monospace intro text has line breaks removed and max-width restricted.
  - Connect button grid stacks vertically (`grid-template-columns: 1fr`). Button height becomes `80px`.
- **600px and down**:
  - Services grid collapses to single column (`grid-template-columns: 1fr`). Service cards padding is `36px 24px`, card height reduces.
  - Footer aligns elements vertically (`flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; align-items: flex-start`).
  - Experience timeline layout items convert to simple vertical stacks:
    ```css
    .experience-item {
      grid-template-columns: 40px 1fr 1fr;
      padding: 24px 0;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .duration {
      grid-column: 2 / -1;
      text-align: left;
    }
    ```
- **480px and down**:
  - Header padding is `24px 24px`. Main content padding is `100px 24px 100px 24px`.
  - Nav links gap is `16px`. Avatar size is `64px`.
  - Hero title size reduces to `2.8rem` with `line-height: 1.0`.

