  '# System Specification Prompt: Alex Rivera Portfolio Landing Page

Build a premium visual and brand designer portfolio landing page for "Alex Rivera" using Next.js (App Router), React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Framer Motion, GSAP, and Lenis (smooth scrolling). The site must feature a polished dark/light mode toggle with state persistence, custom smooth inertia scrolling, character/word reveal scroll animations, custom cursor interactions, and horizontal scrolling components.

