## Global Styles & Theming System

### CSS Custom Properties (`globals.css`)
Implement custom color palettes utilizing HSL/RGB values driven by CSS variables. Enable a dark theme by default, and a light theme toggled via the `.light` class on the `<html>` element.

```css
@tailwind base;
@tailwind components;
@tailwind utilities;

:root {
  /* Dark theme (default) */
  --color-bg: 11 11 12;
  --color-bg-elevated: 21 21 22;
  --color-text-primary: 246 245 241;
  --color-text-muted: 154 154 149;
  --color-border: 246 245 241;
  --color-accent: 215 255 63; /* Vibrant Lime/Yellow */
  --color-accent-contrast: 11 11 12;
  --color-overlay: 11 11 12;
  --color-border-alpha: 0.12;
  --color-overlay-alpha: 0.55;
}

:root.light {
  /* Light theme */
  --color-bg: 247 246 242;
  --color-bg-elevated: 255 255 255;
  --color-text-primary: 11 11 12;
  --color-text-muted: 91 91 86;
  --color-border: 11 11 12;
  --color-accent: 74 93 0; /* Deep olive green */
  --color-accent-contrast: 11 11 12;
  --color-overlay: 11 11 12;
  --color-border-alpha: 0.10;
  --color-overlay-alpha: 0.35;
}

* {
  border-color: rgb(var(--color-border) / var(--color-border-alpha));
}

body {
  background-color: rgb(var(--color-bg));
  color: rgb(var(--color-text-primary));
  font-family: var(--font-body), system-ui, sans-serif;
  transition: background-color 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}

/* Custom Selection styling */
::selection {
  background: rgb(var(--color-accent));
  color: rgb(var(--color-accent-contrast));
}

/* Texture & Custom Styles */
.grain-overlay::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  opacity: 0.06;
  background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=''0 0 200 200'' xmlns=''http://www.w3.org/2000/svg''%3E%3Cfilter id=''n''%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=''fractalNoise'' baseFrequency=''0.9'' numOctaves=''3'' /%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=''100%25'' height=''100%25'' filter=''url(%23n)'' /%3E%3C/svg%3E");
}

.text-stroke {
  -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgb(var(--color-text-primary) / 0.4);
  color: transparent;
}
.text-stroke:hover {
  -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgb(var(--color-accent));
  color: rgb(var(--color-accent));
}

@keyframes marquee {
  from { transform: translateX(0); }
  to { transform: translateX(-33.333%); }
}
.animate-marquee {
  animation: marquee 30s linear infinite;
}
