### Next.js Typography Config (`app/layout.tsx`)
Initialize Google Fonts:
- **Display**: Sora (weights 600, 700) -> mappings: `--font-display`
- **Body**: Inter (weights 400, 500) -> mappings: `--font-body`
- **Monospace**: JetBrains Mono (weight 500) -> mappings: `--font-mono`

Apply a custom script in `<head>` to execute synchronously before the browser paints to prevent flashes of light-mode themes on refresh:
```javascript
(function(){
  try {
    var t = localStorage.getItem(''ar-theme'');
    if (t === ''light'') {
      document.documentElement.classList.add(''light'');
    }
  } catch(e) {}
})();
```

