## Main Sections & Interactions

### 1. Hero Section (`Hero.tsx`)
- Centered layout, vertical min-h-screen, custom Unsplash image background (`photo-1561070791-36c11767b26a`) at `20%` opacity blended with a vertical dark-to-bg gradient mask and a noise texture grain overlay.
- Eyebrow status label: Render green/accent blinking dot alongside monospace text `(Available for new projects)`.
- Main Heading (`h1`): Uses text sizes `text-hero` clamp values. Stagger name words.
- Rotating Role Display: The second text line transitions roles ("BRAND DESIGNER", "ART DIRECTOR", "VISUAL STORYTELLER", "TYPE ENTHUSIAST") inside an `AnimatePresence` with rotating exit states (`initial={{ y: "100%" }}`, `animate={{ y: "0%" }}`, `exit={{ y: "-100%" }}`). Rotate every 2.5 seconds. Hovering over this area pauses the rotating interval.
- Left-aligned description body displaying tagline, followed by CTAs: Magnetic button "View Work" and a raw text link "Get in touch" with a shifting arrow symbol.
- Absolute bottom center scroll cue arrow translating up/down indefinitely via an infinite loop.

### 2. Marquee Section (`Marquee.tsx`)
- Endlessly looping keyword banner. Keywords: "BRANDING", "EDITORIAL DESIGN", "ART DIRECTION", "PACKAGING", "MOTION", "TYPE SYSTEMS" separated by bullet points (`•`).
- Duplicate keywords 3x in a flex row container. Map linear infinite keyframe animation `translateX(0)` to `translateX(-33.333%)` running for 30s.
- Interactive Pause: Hovering over the banner pauses scroll animation (`animationPlayState: ''paused''`), and mouse leave resumes it.
- Text items utilize outlined stroke effect (`.text-stroke`) and fill with solid accent color on item hover.

### 3. Selected Work Section (`SelectedWork.tsx`)
- Heading: `NumberedLabel` ("001", "Selected Work"), Heading ("Recent Projects") split by words using a staggered delay reveal animation.
- Desktop layout (`lg:`): horizontal scroll track snapping cards to container bounds. Hide scrollbar indicators.
- Mobile layout: standard vertical stack of cards.
- Project Card details:
  - Container inherits `data-cursor="view"` property to interact with the custom mouse cursor.
  - Image element in 4:3 aspect ratio zooming on parent hover.
  - Top header overlays: Absolute positioned category tag and year tag styled with frosted borders and backdrop filter blurs.
  - Render an absolute positioned "Coming Soon" badge if marked in data.
  - Bottom metadata: Card title, description text, and a bottom border line expanding to full width on parent hover.
- End Card: A text CTA card "View all work" with an interactive arrow.

### 4. About Section (`About.tsx`)
- Split 2-column layout on desktop:
  - **Left**: Portrait placeholder image in 4:5 aspect ratio with a subtle drop shadow (`shadow-portrait`), animated with slide in from left on view.
  - **Right**:
