    - Bio paragraphs staggered in with delayed vertical fade-up effects.
    - Stats: 3 columns displaying numbers (8+, 60+, 20+) and labels ("Years", "Projects", "Happy Clients").
- **Stat Counter Animation**: When entering the viewport, use requestAnimationFrame to count values up from `0` to the actual number over 1.5 seconds, using an ease-out interpolation (`1 - Math.pow(1 - progress, 3)`). Disable for users preferring reduced motion.

### 5. Services Section (`Services.tsx`)
- Header: `NumberedLabel` ("003", "Services"), Title ("What I Do").
