## Responsive Breakpoints & Performance
- Mobile-first CSS styling using tailwind breakpoints: `sm` (640px), `md` (768px), `lg` (1024px), `xl` (1280px).
- Rely on fluid sizing clamp calculations (e.g., `clamp(2.75rem, 9vw, 8rem)` for margins, font sizes, paddings).
- Scroll event listeners must execute in `{ passive: true }` modes.
- Apply `will-change: transform` to custom cursor loops, marquee scroll layers, and horizontal translation nodes for rendering performance.',
