**Panel CSS:**
- Base (`.s4-panel`): `border-radius: 24px`, `overflow: hidden`, `position: relative`, `transition: all 0.5s ease`
- Image: `width: 100%`, `height: 100%`, `object-fit: cover`, `transition: all 0.5s ease`
- `.collapsed`: `flex: 1`, `cursor: pointer`, image `opacity: 0.4` (hover: `0.6`)
- `.active`: `flex: 4`, image `opacity: 1`

Each panel has 2 overlapping `.s4-panel-content` divs (`position: absolute`, full size, `padding: 3rem`, `transition: opacity 0.5s ease`):
- `.centered`: `align-items: center`, `justify-content: center`, `text-align: center` — shown when collapsed
- `.spread`: `flex-direction: column`, `justify-content: space-between` — shown when active

CSS visibility rules:
- `collapsed .spread` → `opacity: 0`, `pointer-events: none`
- `collapsed .centered` → `opacity: 1`
- `active .spread` → `opacity: 1`
- `active .centered` → `opacity: 0`, `pointer-events: none`

