- **Buttons**: Two patterns — white pill (primary CTA) and ghost pill (secondary). Both `border-radius: 30px` with circle arrow icon on the right
- **Transitions**: `all 0.5s ease` on accordion/gallery; `0.2s` on hover states
- **Watermark numbers**: Sections 4 and 5 have `rgba(255,255,255,0.03)` giant "01"/"02" watermarks adding depth
