  'Build a premium, atmospheric landing page for "Dynamite Studio" (a premium game concept art studio) using HTML, Vanilla CSS, and Vanilla JavaScript. The page has a pure black background (#000000) and loads the fonts Outfit (weights 400, 700, 800) and Space Mono (weights 400, 700) from Google Fonts. The page title is "Dynamite Studio — Premium Game Concept Art".

GLOBAL STYLES
Background: #000000 on html, body, and all wrappers.
Font family: ''Space Mono'', monospace by default; ''Outfit'', sans-serif for brand text.
Global reset: box-sizing border-box, margin 0, padding 0, user-select none.
Hide body scrollbars by default (overflow: hidden; height: 100vh).
Selection highlight: background-color #ff735c, color #ffffff.

SECTION ORDER
1. BACKGROUND CONTAINER (bg-container)
2. HEADER (header)
3. MAIN NAVIGATION ARROWS (nav-arrow)
4. MAIN CONTENT GRID (main-content)

1. BACKGROUND CONTAINER (bg-container)
An absolute positioned container covering the full viewport (z-index: 1).
It contains two background image layers (bg-layer) for smooth crossfades and a gradient overlay (bg-overlay) on top.
- Background Layer: Absolute, full width/height, background-size: contain, background-position: center, background-repeat: no-repeat. Set active layers to opacity: 1, inactive layers to opacity: 0. Add transform: scale(1.05) when inactive and transform: scale(1) when active. Transition opacity and transform over 1.2s using cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1).
- Background Overlay: Absolute, full width/height, z-index: 2. Applies a radial gradient:
  radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8) 75%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 1) 100%)
  combined with a linear gradient:
  linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6) 0%, transparent 20%, transparent 80%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9) 100%).

2. HEADER (header)
Fixed-position header at the top (z-index: 100), flex layout stretching full-width with space-between. Padding: 2.5rem 4rem.
- Logo (left): Contains a custom SVG logo icon and brand text "Dynamite Studio" (font ''Outfit'', weight 700, size 1.15rem, letter-spacing -0.01em, color #ffffff). Logo icon is coral colored (#ff735c), size 28px x 28px, consisting of a circle at cx=9 cy=9 r=4.5 and a path: M16 9C16 12.866 12.866 16 9 16H4V28H16C22.6274 28 28 22.6274 28 16C28 9.37258 22.6274 4 16 4V9Z. The icon rotates 90 degrees on hover with a 0.6s ease.
