  - Hamburger Menu: Transparent button (width 24px, height 14px) containing three horizontal 2px white bars (menu-line). On hover, lines turn coral (#ff735c).

3. MAIN NAVIGATION ARROWS (nav-arrow)
Absolute positioned navigation arrows on the left and right screen edges at top: 50%, transform: translateY(-50%).
- Left Arrow: Placed at left: 3rem, containing a minimal SVG arrow pointing left (width 28px, height 28px, stroke-width 2, square linecap). On hover, moves left: transform: translateY(-50%) translateX(-6px), color becomes #ffffff, and background-color becomes rgba(255,255,255,0.05).
- Right Arrow: Placed at right: 3rem, containing a minimal SVG arrow pointing right. On hover, moves right: transform: translateY(-50%) translateX(6px), color becomes #ffffff, and background-color becomes rgba(255,255,255,0.05).
- On click/active: scales down slightly to 0.92.

4. MAIN CONTENT GRID (main-content)
Flex layout at the bottom of the page, space-between, items-end. Padding: 0 4.5rem 5rem 4.5rem.
- Left Column (content-left): Max-width 65%, display flex, flex-direction column.
  - Left Description: Paragraph text in Space Mono, size 0.95rem, line-height 1.7, color rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7), max-width 320px. Margins: margin-bottom 2.2rem. Incorporates text fade transitions (.text-transition).
  - Title Container: Targeted container that dynamically renders custom SVG glyphs for titles. Glyphs are sized using .title-glyph (width 4.8rem, height auto). Individual letter paths are drawn with a stroke-width of 11, linecap square, linejoin miter, stroke #ffffff, fill none.
  - Stagger Animation: Titles slide up and fade in letter-by-letter. Letters start at opacity: 0 and transform: translateY(20px), transitioning to opacity: 1 and translateY(0) with an incremental inline transition-delay of 0.05s per letter.

- Right Column (content-right): Width 260px, margin-left 2rem, display flex, flex-direction column, align-items flex-start.
  - Slide Counter: Flex row with 12px gap displaying the current slide index next to the total. Current slide number in bold white; total slide number in rgba(255,255,255,0.35).
  - Counter Bar: Width 70px, height 2px, background rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12). Contains a fill bar (.counter-bar-fill) with background-color #ff735c that animates its width in increments of 25% (25% for 01, 50% for 02, etc.) using a 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1) transition.
  - Accent Arrow: Styled coral (#ff735c) SVG arrow (viewBox 0 0 48 48, stroke-width 3, path: M 8 12 V 36 M 8 24 H 40 M 30 14 L 40 24 L 30 34). Arrow shifts right by 8px on hover of the right column block.
  - Right Description: Space Mono, size 0.85rem, line-height 1.7, color rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45), margin-bottom 1.8rem.
  - Upcoming Button: Monospace text "Upcoming" with a bottom border of 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15). Features a play triangle SVG icon (fill #ffffff, width 12px, height 12px). On hover, text and play icon turn coral (#ff735c), bottom border highlights coral, and the play icon slides right by 4px.

DECORATIVE EDGE ACCENTS
Two absolute positioned visual guide lines (side-indicator) of width 1px, height 45px, fading out at both ends using a gradient: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25) 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0)).
- Left indicator: position absolute, left 3.5rem, top 22%.
- Right indicator: position absolute, right 3.5rem, top 48%.

SLIDE CAROUSEL LOGIC
