  - Background Image: /concept_art_bg_4.png

Slide Transition Logic:
- Navigation triggers: clicking Left/Right on-screen arrows, or pressing Left/Right keyboard arrow keys.
- Throttle: 1s lock (isTransitioning) to prevent animation clipping.
- Background Crossfade: Transition background-image onto the inactive layer, toggle the active class, and swap active/inactive layer references.
- Text Fades: Add class .text-out (opacity: 0, translateY(-8px)) to descriptions, wait 400ms, update text content, and remove class .text-out to fade them back in.
- Title Re-render: Clear title container, inject new SVG letter groups, and trigger stagger fade-in transition.

