   - Links: "HOME", "EXHIBITIONS", "ΛRMOR & WEΛPONS", "KNIGHTS & LEGENDS", "VISIT US" (all matching the Greek Lambda `Λ` styling).
   - Style: `font-size: 14px`, `font-weight: 500`, `letter-spacing: 0.1em`, uppercase, `opacity: 0.55`. On hover, transition opacity to `1`.
