3. **Mobile Menu Toggle (Burger Button)**:
   - Display: Hidden on desktop (`display: none`). Appears at screen width `< 1024px`.
   - Style: 3 lines stacked vertically (`gap: 6px`, `width: 24px`, `height: 2px` per line, color `var(--text-white)`).
   - Interaction: Clicking opens a full-screen overlays menu (`.mobile-menu`) with `z-index: 100` and links stacked vertically. Clicking a close button or any links fades the menu out.

---

## 4. Main Section & Aspect-Locked Grid
- **Container Layout**:
  - The main container `.main-section` has `width: 100%`, `position: relative`.
  - Content wraps inside a `.viewport-container` locked to an aspect ratio (`width: 100%`, `aspect-ratio: 1200 / 640`, `max-height: calc(100vh - 160px)`, `margin: 0 auto`).
- **Layers**:
  1. `.svg-background` (z-index: 1): Holds the custom desktop background SVG.
  2. `.container-bg-image` and `.container-bg-overlay` (z-index: 1): Holds the masked hero image.
  3. `.content-layer` (z-index: 2): Absolute-positioned text and interactive components. Set `pointer-events: none` on the layer and `pointer-events: auto` on interactive children.

---

