    - Turns down to `420 596`, curves right to `396 620` (forming a curved notch outline for the center pill button).
    - Extends left to `64`, curves down to `40 596`.
    - Runs vertically up to `40 324`, curves right to `64 300` and horizontally to `336 300`.
    - Curves up to `360 276` and vertically up to `360 144`, curving right back to start at `384 120` (forming a custom bottom-left card slot outline and a custom top-left heading notch outline).
