    d="M 384 120 H 1136 A 24 24 0 0 1 1160 144 V 596 A 24 24 0 0 1 1136 620 H 1124 A 24 24 0 0 1 1100 596 V 564 A 24 24 0 0 0 1076 540 H 1044 A 24 24 0 0 0 1020 564 V 596 A 24 24 0 0 1 996 620 H 764 A 24 24 0 0 1 740 596 V 564 A 24 24 0 0 0 716 540 H 404 A 24 24 0 0 0 380 564 V 596 A 24 24 0 0 1 356 620 H 64 A 24 24 0 0 1 40 596 V 324 A 24 24 0 0 1 64 300 H 336 A 24 24 0 0 1 360 276 V 144 A 24 24 0 0 1 384 120 Z"
    ```
- **SVG Fills and Strokes**:
  - Fill: Linear gradient from `#0a0909` to `#0e0d0d` (`id="bgGrad"`).
  - Stroke: `#2a2522` (warm iron border), `stroke-width="1.2"`, `vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"`.
  - Highlight Overlay: A duplicate path filled with a radial gradient centered at 50% width and 40% height, glowing from `#1b1816` (opacity 0.6) to transparent.
  - Background Noise Layer: A `<rect>` filled with SVG fractal noise (`baseFrequency="0.8"`, `numOctaves="4"`) clipped precisely to the SVG path using `<clipPath id="containerClip">`.

---

## 6. Background Image & CSS Masking
- **Element**: `.container-bg-image` positioned absolutely (`inset: 0`, `z-index: 1`).
- **Mockup Image URL**: `https://i.ibb.co/gbpNVd5J/Chat-GPT-Image-Jul-6-2026-08-42-52-PM.png`
- **Sizing & Fitting**:
