  - `background-position: center`, `background-repeat: no-repeat`.
  - Clip to the vector container: `clip-path: url(#containerClip)`.
  - Opacity: `1` (100% visible).
- **Overlapping Prevention Mask**:
  - To prevent overlapping of the mockup''s text/borders with the page''s HTML elements, apply a linear-gradient CSS mask. This hides the left `30%` and right `30%` of the background image, revealing only the center knight helmet:
    ```css
    -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0%, transparent 30%, black 36%, black 64%, transparent 70%, transparent 100%);
    mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0%, transparent 30%, black 36%, black 64%, transparent 70%, transparent 100%);
    ```
  - Animation: Fade in on page load (`opacity` from `0` to `1` over `1.5s` ease-out).

---

