## 9. Mobile Responsiveness (< 1024px Layout)
On tablet and mobile viewports, wrap elements into a fluid vertical stacking layout:
- **Margins**: Remove absolute grid-locked coordinates. Reset container width and padding (`padding: 0 40px 40px` on mobile section, `padding: 0 20px 30px` on screens `< 480px`).
- **SVG Grid Curves**: Hide the desktop SVG background layout (`display: none`).
- **Background Image**:
  - Reset clip path (`clip-path: none`).
  - Set opacity to a subtle `0.15` (to keep the text readable).
  - Move below the content stacking index (`z-index: 0`).
  - Set overlay background to a vertical fading gradient: `linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(8, 7, 7, 0.4) 0%, rgba(8, 7, 7, 0.95) 100%)`.
