  - Set `position: static` and `width: 100%` on the heading, about box, and bottom cards.
  - Heading: Font size `48px` (mobile-centered).
  - Bottom-Left Card: Width becomes `100%`, height adapts automatically to fit the content (`height: auto`, `min-height: 200px`).
  - Buttons: The pill button and arrow button become full width (`width: 100%`, `position: static`, `border-radius: 28px`, `margin-top: 10px`).
