  '',
  'Build a premium, high-fidelity marketing agency landing page for "Sensato Group" using HTML5, Vanilla CSS, and Vanilla JavaScript. The page has a dark, immersive theme featuring a fullscreen background image overlaid with a subtle ambient radial glow, featuring a large liquid-textured animated headline and an overlapping centered foreground graphic. The layout is structured as a single-page view with high-quality typography, pill-shaped borders, and responsive design systems.

GLOBAL STYLES & SYSTEM TOKENS
Background: Fullscreen cover background image (hero_bg.png) centered and non-repeating, with a fallback solid black color (#000000).
Ambient Glow Overlay: A fixed, fullscreen overlay element (.ambient-glow) with a low-opacity radial gradient: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 80%).
