SECTION CONFIGURATION
1. HEADER (NAVIGATION BAR)
Spans the full width using flex layout with justify-between.
Left Segment: Flex row with a 2.8rem gap.
Logo: A custom geometric SVG logo featuring a square frame (rect with rx="2", stroke width 2.5px) wrapping a blocky path forming the letter "S".
Pill Navigation Links: Flex-row list with a 0.6rem gap. Each nav item (.nav-pill) is a text link styled with a thin border (rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25)), Inter font, 0.8rem size, and wide elliptical padding (0.55rem 1.3rem). Active hovers transition text to black, background to solid white, and project a soft white glow shadow. Links: "SensatcGroup", "Our works", "News".
Right Segment: Flex row with a 1.5rem gap.
Nav Links: Same wide elliptical pills: "Cases", "Help".
Contact Button: A solid white pill (.contact-btn) with black text, reversing styling to transparent background with white border on hover.
2. HERO SECTION
Flex container centered vertically and horizontally, spanning 100vw width with negative horizontal margins (calc(-1 * var(--padding-x))) to bleed edge-to-edge.
Text Logo ("SENSATO"): Massive heading using variable font ''Archivo'' configured with axes width wdth 74, weight wght 900.
Size is set to 20vw with line-height 0.72 and letter-spacing -0.038em to prevent word-wrapping.
Implements text clipping (background-clip: text) mapping a monochrome liquid caustics texture (sensato_text_texture.png) inside the uppercase letters.
