Animates with a smooth entrance scale-up (entranceZoom) from 0.4 to 1 with opacity fade-in over 2.2s using cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1).
Shrinks/zooms smoothly on hover to a scale factor of 1.08 with a transition of 0.8s. No CSS filters are applied to this image.
3. INFO SECTION (MIDDLE ROW)
Flex row layout spanning full width with space-between alignment and a 4rem gap.
Left Column (28% width, min-width 280px): Left-aligned description paragraph displaying: "Welcome to the official website of Sensato Group! We are a leading marketing agency specializing in performance marketing, brand development, and creative design. If you want to grow your business to the next level, we are your reliable partner." in size 0.85rem, line-height 1.6, and secondary white.
