INSERT INTO public.templates (title, category, type, image, video, prompt, likes, published, position)
VALUES (
  'Zenrixa',
  'Hero Section, Portfolio',
  'Premium',
  'https://pub-6e6682d5b928477ab40c1873a1345ec5.r2.dev/images/1783535014536-1hiqirj.png',
  '',
  '# Zenrixa Landing Page Specification Prompt

Build a premium, interactive agency landing page for "Zenrixa" using HTML, Vanilla CSS, and Vanilla JavaScript. The page has a dark, high-contrast theme featuring a full-viewport silhouette background image, custom typography, an interactive card slider, and a dynamic timezone clock.

## GLOBAL STYLES
- **Background:** #000000 (Pitch black base) on `body`, with a fixed background image.
- **Font family:** ''Outfit'', sans-serif (imported from Google Fonts, weights 300 to 800).
- **Global reset:** box-sizing `border-box`, margin `0`, padding `0`, smooth antialiasing.
- **Background Image Layer (`.hero-bg-image`):** Centered profile silhouette of a man wearing orange goggles against a light grey/white background. CSS properties: position `fixed`, top `0`, left `0`, width `100vw`, height `100vh`, background-size `cover`, background-position `center 15%`, background-repeat `no-repeat`, opacity `1`, z-index `-1`, pointer-events `none`.
- **Main Wrapper (`.app-container`):** Relative position, min-height `100vh`, flex column layout, max-width `1600px`, centered (`margin: 0 auto`), padding `0 40px` on desktop.

---

## SECTION ORDER
- Header/Navbar
- HeroSection (Left Column: Headline & CTAs; Right Column: Card Slider & Partners Grid)
- BottomBar

---

## 1. HEADER / NAVBAR
Horizontal header bar spanning the top of the viewport. Height `100px`, flexbox layout with `justify-content: space-between` and `align-items: center`.

- **Logo (Left):** Flex container containing:
  - **Icon:** Custom SVG rhombus logo. Tilted at 45 degrees, segmented border stroke (`currentColor`, dashed `14 8`), solid white/black inner square, and a concentric diagonal diamond border. On hover, rotates 45 degrees with a `0.4s` smooth transition.
  - **Text:** Wordmark "Zenrixa" in font size `24px`, bold (font-weight 600), letter-spacing `-0.5px`, color black.
- **Nav Links (Center):** Horizontal list of links: "Home", "Product", "About", "Brands", "Carrers" (spelled with double ''r''), and "Partners". Text color `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7)` (semi-muted), font size `15px`.
  - **Home (Active link):** Text color black. Underlined by a small hollow circle dot (`5px` width/height, border `1px solid black`) positioned absolutely `12px` below.
  - **Product Link:** Accompanied by a clean down chevron SVG (`stroke="currentColor"`).
- **Header Widgets (Right):** Flex container with gap `16px`:
  - **Timezone Widget:** Outlined rounded box (`border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12)`, background `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03)`, border-radius `8px`, padding `8px 18px`). Displays label "Timezone" (font-size `9px`, uppercase, color `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45)`) and a live clock showing Warsaw time (CET/CEST) formatted as `03:00pm • 23 June, 2024` (dynamically updating in JavaScript).
  - **Menu Button:** Outlined button (`border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12)`, background `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03)`, border-radius `8px`, padding `10px 18px`, text "MENU" in font size `12px`, uppercase, font-weight 600). Left-aligned horizontal hamburger SVG.

---

## 2. HERO SECTION
Main section beneath the header. Flex layout with `justify-content: space-between`, gap `36px`, padding-top `54px`, and padding-bottom `36px`.

### Left Column (Copy & CTAs)
- **Tagline:** Flex container with a vertical grey line (`width: 1px`, `height: 16px`) and text "Creative Agency" in font size `14px`, color `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7)`, weight 300.
- **Main Heading:** Massive H1 with text "We start from zero, delivering only what matters.". Font size `74px`, bold (font-weight 500), line-height `1.05`, letter-spacing `-2px`.
  - The words "from", "delivering", and "only what" are enclosed in `.muted-text` elements, colored `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45)`.
- **Social Proof:** Five orange rating stars (`#ff5c00`, font-size `15px`) next to text "3000+ Customers" in font size `13px`, color `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7)`.
- **CTA Buttons:** Flex container with gap `16px`:
  - **Chat With Us Button:** Outlined pill button (`border: 1.5px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4)`, padding `0 6px 0 20px`, height `48px`, border-radius `50px`, font-size `14px`, black text). Right side contains a solid white circle (`34px` width/height) containing a black vector arrow (`→`). On hover, the circle scales and rotates the arrow 45 degrees, and the button border colors turn to solid black.
  - **Our Works Button:** Solid grey button (`background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)`, black text, padding `0 28px`, height `48px`, border-radius `50px`, font-size `14px`). Moves upward slightly on hover.

### Right Column (Card Slider & Partners)
Vertical flex container aligned to the right:

- **Interactive Carousel Card:**
  - Glassmorphic card layout (`backdrop-filter: blur(24px)`, background `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015)`, border `1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12)`, border-radius `25px`, padding `21px`, max-width `432px`, min-height `216px`, gap `22px`).
  - **Card Inner Left:** Employs a dark brand box container (`background: #090909`, border `1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15)`, border-radius `18px`, width `100%`, aspect-ratio `1/1`). Encloses a white blocky logo monogram and registered mark (`®`) in the bottom-right corner.
  - **Card Inner Right:** Flex layout containing:
    - **Header:** Displays index number (e.g. `01` in font size `13px`, color `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45)`) and a circular plus button (`+`, outlined, scaling on hover).
    - **Title:** Bold card header (font-size `23px`, weight 500, line-height 1.2, black color).
    - **Footer:** Progress bar (height `2px`, grey background, white fill width changing dynamically) and two navigation arrows (`←` and `→`, circular buttons that swap background/stroke colors on hover).
  - **Carousel Slides:**
    - Slide 1: Index "01", Title "Design to explore.", Progress fill width `33%`
    - Slide 2: Index "02", Title "Deliver what matters.", Progress fill width `66%`
    - Slide 3: Index "03", Title "Scale to infinite.", Progress fill width `100%`
- **Partners Container:** Flex container with gap `14px`, max-width `432px`.
  - **Label:** "Our Partners" aligned to the right (`font-size: 13px`, semi-muted).
  - **Grid:** 4 columns in row 1, 3 columns in row 2.
  - **Partner Logo Items:** Flex elements with custom SVG emblems and text labels:
    - Row 1: `zantic` (cross SVG), `BookStore` (vertical book shapes), `Winger` (outlined butterfly), `Winger` ( butterfly repeat).
    - Row 2: `Crono` (solid diamond), `Mercury` (curved waves), `Crono` (diamond repeat).
  - Partners text and logos use `currentColor` to dynamically color match the black text theme.

---

## 3. BOTTOM BAR
A floating glassmorphic bar docked at the bottom of the screen. Height `64px`, border-radius `100px`, background `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.01)`, blur filter `12px`, border `1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)`, padding `0 32px`.
- **Left:** Small glowing orange dot (`background: #ff5c00`, box-shadow glow) next to the text "View Exp".
- **Center:** Muted text reading "Based in Warsaw".
- **Right:** Outlined pill button with a glowing orange dot and text "Scroll Down" (`background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06)`, border `1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)`, padding `8px 18px`, border-radius `100px`, black text).

---

## 4. DYNAMIC JAVASCRIPT LOGIC
Implement a script that executes on DOM loading to drive the interactive features:
1. **Dynamic Clock:** Targets the `#timezone-clock` element. Using `Intl.DateTimeFormat` configured with timeZone `Europe/Warsaw`, updates local time every minute. Formats output strings exactly like the reference design: `hh:mmap • DD Month, YYYY` (e.g. `10:31pm • 8 July, 2026`).
