  '',
  '# "Where Creativity Meets AI" - Single-Page Landing Page Prompt

Build a premium, high-fidelity AI-themed landing page based on the "Where Creativity Meets AI" design. The site uses HTML, Vanilla CSS, and Vanilla JavaScript, with Inter as the primary typography. It features a dark theme (#000000), ambient mouse-tracking color glows, a glassmorphic floating header capsule navigation, a central CTA button, and a full-size background image.

## GLOBAL STYLES & SETUP
- **Background**: Solid black `#000000` on the body, with a minimum height of `100vh`, laid out using flex direction column to stretch content vertically.
- **Typography**: Primary font family is `''Inter''`, loaded from Google Fonts (weights: 300, 400, 500, 600, 700). Include modern browser system font fallbacks. 
- **Global Reset**: Set `box-sizing: border-box`, `margin: 0`, and `padding: 0` for all elements.
- **Ambient Glowing Lights**: Two absolute circular container elements (`.bg-glow`) with blur filter of `150px` and opacity `0.15` that sit behind the main layout. 
  - Glow 1 is positioned at top-left/center with a cyan radial gradient.
  - Glow 2 is positioned at bottom-right with a purple radial gradient.
- **Edge Overflow**: Maintain `overflow-x: hidden` on the body to prevent any horizontal scrollbars.

---

## SECTION STRUCTURE & LAYOUT

The page layout consists of three primary vertical components:
1. **Header Navigation (Pill Capsule Navbar)**
2. **Main Hero Section (Top-aligned)**
3. **Explore Footer (Scroll Indicator)**

Additionally, a full-page background image wrapper sits behind the content (`z-index: -1`).

---

### 1. BACKGROUND IMAGE LAYER
- **Layout**: Absolute-positioned container filling `100%` width and height.
- **Image Handling (100% Visibility)**: The image element wrapper must maintain a strict 16:9 aspect-ratio layout (`aspect-ratio: 16 / 9`, `max-width: 100%`, `max-height: 100%`) centered using flexbox. This ensures the background image is fully visible without any cropping, cutoff, or scaling distortion on any desktop or mobile display aspect ratio.
- **Image URL**: `https://res.cloudinary.com/z2uss7l7/image/upload/v1783360407/ChatGPT_Image_Jul_6_2026_11_13_52_PM_o8qwcr.png`
- **Blend Style**: No vignettes or overlays over the image edges. Keep the image''s raw borders and contrast clear, centering it on the dark screen background.

---

### 2. HEADER & CAPSULE NAVIGATION
- **Layout**: Centered header container padded top by `36px` (reduced to `20px` on mobile screens).
- **Navbar Capsule**: A horizontal pill container (`width: 640px`, `max-width: 90%`) utilizing glassmorphism styles:
  - Background: Semi-transparent dark background (`rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.65)`) with a blur filter (`backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(180%)`).
  - Border: Subtle cyan glass border (`1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.22)`).
  - Shadows: Multi-layered shadow system:
    - Soft outer blur: `0 8px 32px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8)`
    - Inner edge highlight: `inset 0 1px 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)`
    - Ambient cyan glow: `0 0 20px 0 rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.12)`
  - Transition: Smooth hover transition on border and box-shadow over `0.4s`.
  - Hover State: Border opacity increases to `rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.35)` and glow shadow expands to `0 0 30px 2px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.18)`.
- **Navigation Components**:
  - **Logo**: A white SVG icon replicating a stylized crescent shape with a separate dot (dot at `cx=20, cy=12, r=4.5`; shape path `M10 12C10...`). It rotates slightly by `6deg` and scales to `1.05` on hover.
  - **Links**: Four text links: "How It Works", "Use Cases", "Pricing", and "Learn". Text is styled in light-gray `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72)` with a size of `0.88rem`, weight `450`, and `-0.01em` letter spacing. On hover, links fade to full white and receive a subtle white glow shadow. Hidden on mobile screens.
  - **Sign Up Button**: An outlined pill capsule button on the right of the navbar. Styled with white border at `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15)`, very light background `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02)`, and `0.88rem` font size. On hover, it morphs its borders to bright cyan (`rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.85)`), glows softly, and shifts upwards by `0.5px`.

---

### 3. HERO CONTENT SECTION
- **Layout**: Top-aligned container (`justify-content: flex-start`, `padding: 100px 20px 40px 20px`) inside the central body. Max-width of contents is limited to `850px`.
- **Hero Title**:
  - Text: `"Where Creativity Meets AI"`
  - Typography: Size `3.2rem` (scaled to `2.8rem` on mobile), font weight `500`, tracking `-0.03em`, and line-height `1.15`.
  - Styling: Filled with a clean vertical white-to-gray gradient (`linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #ececec 100%)`) using background-clip text.
  - Readability: Fitted with a double drop shadow (`filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)) drop-shadow(0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85))`) to keep text readable against the dark celestial clouds of the background image.
  - Animation: Fades and slides down (`fadeInDown` keyframes) over `0.8s`.
- **Hero Subtitle**:
  - Text: `"For visionaries and creators who want more than inspiration - AI that builds with you. Harness the power of AI to transform your imagination into compelling content."`
  - Typography: Size `1.15rem` (scaled to `1rem` on mobile), line-height `1.65`, font weight `400`, color `rgba(142, 145, 150, 1)`.
