  '',
  '# iaculus — Venture Studio Landing Page Specification

Build a premium minimalist venture studio landing page for "iaculus" using semantic HTML5 and Vanilla CSS. The page fits exactly on a single screen (100vh) on desktop devices with a widescreen landscape background, and collapses gracefully into a scrollable flow on mobile devices.

## GLOBAL STYLES & PRESET
- **Reset**: Set box-sizing to `border-box`, margin to `0`, and padding to `0` for all elements.
- **Background**: White (#ffffff) body backdrop. The main wrapper uses a cover-size background image: `https://res.cloudinary.com/z2uss7l7/image/upload/v1783363773/ChatGPT_Image_Jul_7_2026_12_19_21_AM_yqsvqq.png`.
- **Text Color**: Pure black (#000000) for high-contrast visibility.
- **Fonts**: 
  - Serif text: `Cormorant Garamond` (Google Fonts, weights 300-700) for logos, subtitles, and buttons.
  - UI/Heading: `Outfit` (weights 300-700) and `Plus Jakarta Sans` (weights 300-700) for structural/body text and main headlines.
- **Anti-aliasing**: Apply `-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased` globally.
- **Overflow**: On desktop, the page fits 100vh with `overflow: hidden`.

---

## SECTION STRUCTURE

### 1. PAGE WRAPPER (`.page-wrapper`)
- **Layout**: Flexbox column container spanning exactly `100vh` height.
- **Spacing**: Vertical padding of `1.5rem` at the top and `2.5rem` at the bottom, with `5%` horizontal margins.
- **Background Layering**: Features a multi-layered background containing a radial gradient overlay fading from high opacity white in the center to low opacity white at the outer edges: `radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45) 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) 100%)`. Below this overlay, set the landscape image `https://res.cloudinary.com/z2uss7l7/image/upload/v1783363773/ChatGPT_Image_Jul_7_2026_12_19_21_AM_yqsvqq.png` styled with `background-size: 100% 100%`, `background-repeat: no-repeat`, and `background-position: center`.

---

### 2. HEADER NAVBAR (`.navbar`)
- **Layout**: Horizontal flexbox with `justify-content: space-between` and `align-items: center`.
- **Sizing**: `max-width: 1100px`, `width: calc(100% - 40px)`, `margin: 15px auto 0 auto`, `padding: 14px 40px`.
- **Glassmorphism Backdrop**: `background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45)`, `backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(180%)`, border `1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4)`, `border-radius: 9999px` (capsule profile), and a subtle drop shadow `0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03)`.
- **Navbar Elements**:
  - **Logo**: Anchor tag with text "iaculus". Styled with `Cormorant Garamond`, font size `30px`, weight `700`, color `#000000`, `letter-spacing: -0.02em`, and no underline.
  - **Navigation Links**: Flexbox list of anchors with `gap: 36px`. Links: "Learn", "Results", "Services". Font `15px`, color `#000000`, weight `400`. Hover opacity transition to `0.6` over `0.2s`.
  - **Onboard CTA**: Pill button with text "Get onboarded". Background `#000000`, text `#ffffff`, border `1px solid #000000`, padding `8px 20px`, `border-radius: 9999px`. Font family `Cormorant Garamond`, size `15px`, weight `500`. Hover transition switches colors to background `#ffffff` and text `#000000`.

---

### 3. HERO CONTENT (`.hero`)
- **Layout**: Centered flexbox column (`justify-content: center`, `align-items: center`) that grows (`flex-grow: 1`) to fill the center space of the screen.
- **Title (`.hero-title`)**: H1 element with text "World-class venture studio trusted by billion-dollars companies building sustainable solutions". Styled with font `Plus Jakarta Sans`, size `clamp(34px, 4.5vw, 68px)`, weight `600`, line height `1.15`, letter spacing `-0.035em`, and margin bottom `24px`.
- **Subtitle (`.hero-subtitle`)**: Paragraph element with text "We provide distinct solutions that are tailored to the founder needs at each stage of their journey to scale.". Styled with font `Cormorant Garamond`, size `clamp(17px, 1.3vw, 20px)`, weight `500`, line height `1.65`, color `#1a1a1a`, max-width `760px`, and margin bottom `32px`.
- **Actions (`.hero-actions`)**: Flexbox row containing two pill buttons:
  - **Primary CTA (`.btn-hero-primary`)**: Text "Get onboarded". Background `#000000`, text `#ffffff`, border `1px solid #000000`, padding `12px 30px`, `border-radius: 9999px`, font `Cormorant Garamond`, size `17px`, weight `500`. Hover transitions to background `#ffffff`, text `#000000`, and `transform: translateY(-1px)`.
  - **Secondary CTA (`.btn-hero-secondary`)**: Text "Learn more". Background `transparent`, text `#000000`, border `1px solid #d1d1d1`, padding `12px 30px`, `border-radius: 9999px`, font `Cormorant Garamond`, size `17px`, weight `500`. Hover transitions to border `#000000`, background `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02)`, and `transform: translateY(-1px)`.

---

### 4. TRUSTED BY / PARTNERS GRID (`.partners`)
- **Layout**: Centered block containing a title and a floating logo card list.
