  '',
  '
# Lumenet Landing Page Prompt

Use the following detailed prompt to perfectly regenerate the Lumenet landing page.

---

Build a futuristic, minimal landing page for "Lumenet" using HTML, Vanilla CSS, and modern web design principles. The page features a full-screen, high-resolution dashboard/mockup background image, a glassmorphic navbar at the top, a huge bold title "Neutrals" on the bottom-left, and a structured right column with secondary copy and a primary action button.

## GLOBAL STYLES
- **Background**: The background is a full-screen image set on the `body` using `background-image: url(''https://res.cloudinary.com/z2uss7l7/image/upload/v1783366477/ChatGPT_Image_Jul_7_2026_01_03_31_AM_hdmwfs.png'')`. Set `background-size: 100% 100%`, `background-position: center`, and `background-repeat: no-repeat` to ensure the background fits the screen perfectly without any clipping or cutting. Fallback background color is solid black `#000000`.
- **Typography**: The primary font family is `''Inter''`, sans-serif (imported from Google Fonts, weights 400, 500, 600, 700, 800). Fallbacks are system sans-serif fonts.
- **Global Reset**: Use `box-sizing: border-box`, `margin: 0`, and `padding: 0`. Disable viewport scrolling with `overflow: hidden` on the body.
- **Page Container**: Set a flex column wrapper `.page-container` taking up exactly `100vh` height.

## SECTION LAYOUT
The page is split into two main sections inside a `.page-container`:
1. **Header (Navbar)**: Positioned at the top of the viewport.
2. **Main Content**: Expands to fill the remaining space (`flex: 1`), serving as a relative container for the content layout.

---

### 1. NAVBAR (LIQUID GLASSMORPHISM)
A horizontal bar styled with a liquid glassmorphic effect.
- **Layout**: Grid layout (`grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr`) to perfectly align elements.
  - Left column: Navigation links ("Solutions", "Insight", "About", "Contact") aligned to the start.
  - Center column: Centered logo text "Lumenet".
  - Right column: "Get Started" button aligned to the end.
- **Positioning**: Margins `24px 32px`, paddings `8px 8px 8px 32px`, and a highly rounded border-radius `60px`.
- **Glassmorphic Styling**:
  - Background: `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04)`
  - Backdrop Blur: `blur(24px) saturate(180%)`
  - Border: `1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)`
  - Shadow: A soft drop shadow `0 8px 32px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)` combined with a sharp top highlight inset shadow `inset 0 1px 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15)`.
  - Transition: Cubic-bezier transition for smooth state changes `all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.8, 0.25, 1)`.
- **Links**: Font size `14px`, weight `500`, colored with a semi-transparent white `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65)`. On hover, transition to white `#ffffff` and add a soft text glow `text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4)`.
- **Logo**: Text "Lumenet", font size `16px`, weight `600`, color `#ffffff`, letter-spacing `0.03em`, with a permanent subtle glow `text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25)`.

---

### 2. MAIN CONTENT AREA
A relative wrapper `.main-content` taking `flex: 1`, with padding `0 64px 40px` and aligned items to the bottom (`align-items: flex-end`) to position the primary layout.

- **Hero Title ("Neutrals")**:
  - Placed at the bottom-left of the screen.
  - Text: "Neutrals" in white `#ffffff`.
  - Styling: Huge font-size `17vw`, extremely bold `font-weight: 700`, tight line-height `0.78`, and tight letter-spacing `-0.05em`. Offset slightly to the left with `margin-left: -0.05em` for optical alignment with the navbar text.
  
- **Right Column Layout**:
  - Positioned absolutely inside the main content: `position: absolute`, `right: 64px`, `top: 35%`, `bottom: 40px`, width `385px`.
  - Uses a flexbox column with `justify-content: space-between` to separate the header and bottom content.
  - **Secondary Header**: "Enter the Future." at the top of the column. Font size `40px`, weight `400`, letter-spacing `-0.02em`, color `#ffffff`.
  - **Bottom Right Content**: A vertical stack containing the description paragraph and a button.
    - **Description**: 
      "Lumenet blends AI, system architecture, and design to build intuitive, perception-driven digital environments  
      —redefining how humans interact with technology."
      Use a `<br>` before the em-dash to break it exactly as shown. Font size `14px`, weight `400`, line-height `1.6`, color `#999999` (light gray). Margin bottom `24px`.
    - **CTA Button**: A duplicate of the navbar''s "Get Started" button (see styling below).

---

### 3. REUSABLE COMPONENT: GET STARTED BUTTON
A highly polished, premium action button.
- **Pill Shape**: Solid white background `#ffffff`, black text `#000000`, border-radius `40px`.
- **Layout**: Flexbox layout to align text and arrow container: `display: flex`, `align-items: center`, gap `12px`.
- **Dimensions**: Padding `6px 6px 6px 20px`, font size `14px`, weight `600`.
- **Icon Container**: A solid black circle `width: 28px`, `height: 28px`, `border-radius: 50%` containing a centered white right-arrow SVG. The SVG uses a viewBox of `0 0 24 24` with stroke-width `2`, stroke-linecap `round`, and stroke-linejoin `round`.
- **Interaction**: Pointer cursor, transition opacity on hover with a `0.2s` duration (`opacity: 0.9` on hover).

---

## RESPONSIVE BREAKPOINTS
- On smaller screens (max-width: 1024px):
  - Scale down the huge title to `16vw`.
  - Reduce the right column width to `320px` to keep it proportional and prevent text overlaps.
