  '',
  '# DgtlCore Landing Page — Complete Build Prompt

Build a single-page landing page for a digital agency called **"DgtlCore"** using plain **HTML**, **CSS**, and **JavaScript** (no frameworks). The page title is `DgtlCore`. Use **Playfair Display** (weights 400, 500; also italic 400) and **Inter** (weights 400, 500) from Google Fonts.

