## GLOBAL STYLES

- **Background color**: `#fdfdfd`
- **Text color**: `#1a1a1a`
- **Font family**: `''Inter'', sans-serif` on `body`
- **Global reset**: `box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0` on `*`
- `body`: `min-height: 100vh; position: relative; overflow-x: hidden`
- **Google Fonts import** (in `<head>`):
  - `Playfair Display`: weights 400, 500 (normal + italic 400)
  - `Inter`: weights 400, 500

---

## BACKGROUND GRID DECORATION

A full-page decorative layer sits behind all content as `position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; z-index: -1; pointer-events: none`.

### Vertical Lines
Three vertical `1px` lines with `background-color: #e8e8e8`, full height:
- **Line 1**: `left: 10%`
- **Line 2**: `left: 17%`
- **Line 3**: `right: 11%`

### Horizontal Line
One horizontal `1px` line, full width: `top: 100px`

### Star / Sparkle SVGs
Four 4-pointed star SVG icons (`24×24px`) placed absolutely on the vertical lines. Each uses `transform: translate(-50%, -50%)`. The SVG path is:
```
M12 0C12 0 12 10 24 12C24 12 13 12 12 24C12 24 12 13 0 12C0 12 11 12 12 0Z
```
Fill color: `#1A1A1A`

Star positions (relative to their parent vertical line element):
- `.star-left` on Line 1: `top: 55%; left: 0%`
- `.star-mid-top` on Line 2: `top: 15%; left: 0%`
- `.star-mid-bot` on Line 2: `top: 80%; left: 0%`
- `.star-right` on Line 3: `top: 50%; left: 0%`

---

## LAYOUT CONTAINER

A `.container` div wraps all content: `max-width: 100%; margin: 0 auto; position: relative`.

---

## NAVBAR

### Wrapper
`.navbar-wrapper`: `padding-top: 1rem; display: flex; justify-content: center; position: relative; z-index: 10`

### Navbar Bar
