- `src`: a floating island / crystal rock image with transparent background. The image shows a photorealistic rock chunk with green moss, a clear angular crystal gemstone, and delicate wildflowers (white daisies, purple blooms) growing from the top. The background of the image is fully transparent (PNG). The rock floats with a crystal formation pointing downward.
