## DESIGN NOTES

- The page is **single viewport** — `100vh`, no scroll, `overflow: hidden` on body.
- The layout is built entirely with **CSS Grid** (header 3-col, main 2-col, footer 3-col) and **Flexbox** (nav, menu icon, services list).
- The background image is positioned at `center 20%` (slightly upward from center) to frame the subject properly.
- The hamburger icon uses **two lines of different widths** (32px top, 20px bottom) to create the classic asymmetric menu icon look.
- The `.line` CSS class is shared: in the header context it styles the hamburger lines; in `.services-list` it styles the horizontal separator dashes between number and text.
- No JavaScript interactivity is required; `script.js` is linked but empty.
- Color palette: near-black background `#030303`, white text `#f0f0f0`, muted gray `#7a7a7a`, dim separator `#333333`, footer text `#d0d0d0`, nav default `#8a8a8a`.
