## 9. Key Design Principles

1. **Dark atmospheric theme** — the glowing background image provides all color and depth; UI elements are white/gray/transparent
2. **Mixed typography** — the serif italic *"Better"* against sans-serif bold creates a premium editorial contrast
3. **Pill buttons** — `border-radius: 100px` on all interactive elements for a modern, rounded feel
4. **Frosted badge** — the badge uses `backdrop-filter: blur(10px)` + semi-transparent background for a glassmorphism effect
5. **Full-bleed background** — `background-size: 100% 100%` ensures the image fills every pixel of the viewport across all screen sizes
6. **Underline active state** — the "Home" nav item has a `1.5px` underline with `6px` offset, a subtle but refined detail

