## 1. Full-Screen Looping Background Video
A persistent background video covers the entire viewport under the page content:
- **Video Source URL**: `https://res.cloudinary.com/z2uss7l7/video/upload/v1783374782/Animate_image_with_fixed_camera_202607070255_feyemb.mp4`
- **Video Behavior**: Automatically plays (`autoplay`), loops infinitely (`loop`), is muted (`muted`), and plays inline on mobile browsers (`playsinline`).
- **Video Styling**:
  - Position: `fixed`, pinned to `top: 0` and `left: 0`.
  - Dimensions: `width: 100%`, `height: 100%`.
  - Layout behavior: `object-fit: cover` to ensure it spans the full screen without distortion.
  - Hierarchy: Set `z-index: -1` to place it behind all content, and `pointer-events: none` to prevent it from intercepting clicks.
  - Visual Filter: Apply a brightness filter `filter: brightness(0.6)` (or dimming overlay) to decrease video brightness by 40%, ensuring all white text above it remains perfectly legible.

