  '# Project Prompt Specification: QUOMI Minimalist Design Portfolio

Build a premium, highly aesthetic, minimalist designer portfolio website for "Aleks Jaxon" under the brand name "QUOMI" using standard HTML5, custom Vanilla CSS, and modular JavaScript, bundled with Vite. The interface follows strict editorial grid rules, high-contrast typography, and modern micro-interactions.

---

## 1. Global Specifications & Theme
* **Theme**: Light, clean, high-contrast, premium Swiss editorial style.
* **Palette**:
  * Primary Background: `#fbfbfb` (off-white, matte canvas feel)
  * Primary Text / Active Elements: `#0a0a0a` (charcoal black)
  * Muted Text / Inactive Elements: `#86868b` (neutral cool grey)
  * Grid lines & Borders: `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05)` (very faint grey)
* **Typography**:
  * **Display Font**: `Outfit` (weights 300–900; used for logo, giant titles, numbers, and navigation elements).
  * **Primary Body Font**: `Plus Jakarta Sans` (weights 300–800; used for info rows, body text, descriptions, and labels).
* **Reset**: Default browser margins and paddings are reset to `0`, `box-sizing` set to `border-box`, and text-rendering optimized via `-webkit-font-smoothing`.
* **Smooth Scrolling**: Enabled globally using `html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }`.

---

## 2. Page Architecture & Section Order
The website spans five distinct vertical layers. The background grid lines run continuously behind all sections.

1. **Hero Viewport**: The fold area containing header navigation, status info, a giant typography title with a split blur reflection, and an introductory paragraph.
2. **Selected Work (Section 01)**: A grid of project showcases.
3. **Expertise (Section 02)**: An interactive list of services.
4. **About (Section 03)**: A two-column biography and professional timeline.
5. **Contact & Footer (Section 04)**: Direct call-to-actions, social media lists, and footer copyright text.

---

## 3. Background Layout & Grid Lines
* A fixed container (`.grid-lines`) covers the entire viewport depth (`position: fixed`, `top/bottom: 0`, `left/right: 60px`).
* It renders exactly **5 columns** using CSS Grid: `grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr)`.
* Every grid cell has a left border (`1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05)`), and the last column has a right border to cleanly wrap the layout bounds.
* The content wrapper matches the grid lines'' margins (`padding: 40px 60px`) to align content perfectly to the vertical grid divisions.

---

## 4. Detailed Component Specifications

### 4.1. Hero Viewport
Spans full viewport height (`min-height: 100vh`) with a grid-template containing 4 horizontal rows: `grid-template-rows: auto auto 1fr auto` (Header, Info, Hero Title, Footer).

#### A. Header Row
* Contains the logo and the menu toggle button.
* **Logo**: "QUOMI" in uppercase, heavy weight (`font-weight: 800`), font size `1.5rem`, tracking `-0.03em`. Features a superscripted registered trademark symbol (`®`) styled with a line height of `1`.
* **Menu Button**:
  * Renders as two horizontal lines (`32px` wide, `1.5px` thick, spaced `6px` apart) with a smooth transition on hover.
  * When clicked, it activates a navigation overlay, and the lines rotate into an "X" shape (top line translates down and rotates `45deg`, bottom line translates up and rotates `-45deg`).

#### B. Info Row
Aligns items to the top using a 5-column subgrid:
* **Column 1 (Time & Date)**: Displays the local time in bold (`font-weight: 600`) and the date in a muted grey tone (`color: #86868b`). Updates dynamically via JavaScript.
* **Column 2 (Location)**: Muted paragraph reading "Based in Amsterdam".
* **Column 3 (Status)**: Clean indicator reading "• Available for work". The bullet point is styled as a large dark dot.
* **Column 4**: Empty spacer.
* **Column 5 (Profile Block)**:
  * Aligned to the right. Contains an inline SVG barcode paired side-by-side with a square avatar image.
  * **Barcode SVG**: Spans `48px` high with 6 vertical bars of varying widths (e.g. widths `10`, `3`, `7`, `2`, `5`, `3` with gaps of `4` units).
  * **Avatar**: A sharp square portrait image (`48px` x `48px`, border-radius `2px`).

#### C. Hero Title Row
A typographic showpiece displaying "QUOMI®".
* **Split Blur Reflection Effect**:
  * Utilizes two identical `<h1>` elements stacked vertically in the same container. Both titles use `font-family: ''Outfit''`, size `15vw`, weight `800`, line height `0.85`, tracking `-0.04em`, and uppercase styling.
  * **Sharp Top Layer**: Clipped to show only the upper half using `mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 50%, transparent 50%)`.
  * **Blurred Bottom Layer**: Positioned absolutely directly underneath. Clipped to show the bottom half using `mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 48%, black 50%)`. Applies `filter: blur(14px)` and `opacity: 0.85` to simulate a dark smoky reflection extending downwards.
  * **Trademark Circular Badge (`®`)**: Renders custom-designed via HTML/CSS inline wrapper. Spans `width: 1.2em` and `height: 1.2em`, font size `0.35em`, absolute centering layout, vertical-align `super`, and `border: 0.08em solid currentColor` with a `border-radius: 50%`.

#### D. Footer Row
Divided into two segments:
* **Intro Text (Columns 1–3)**: Font size `1.6rem`, line height `1.4`, muted color. Contains inline highlighted keywords (e.g., "Aleks Jaxon", "for the people", "intuitive, accessible, and engaging.") styled in bold black (`#0a0a0a`).
* **Book Link (Column 5)**: Right-aligned text link reading "Book a call" styled with a solid underline, shifting to a muted state on hover.

---

### 4.2. Selected Work Section (Section 01)
* **Header**: Large display title "Selected Work" (`font-size: 4rem`, weight `800`, uppercase) on the left, paired with `01 / Projects` on the far right.
* **Grid**: Uses a 5-column CSS grid containing four project cards:
  * Card 1: Wide (`grid-column: span 3`)
  * Card 2: Narrow (`grid-column: span 2`)
  * Card 3: Narrow (`grid-column: span 2`)
  * Card 4: Wide (`grid-column: span 3`)
* **Project Card Styling**:
  * Clean outline card with `1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05)`, padding `40px`, and height `380px`.
  * Displays project index number, title (`2.5rem`, bold display font), description sentence, and meta footer (category tags on left, year on right separated by a dashed grid line).
  * **Inverted Interaction**: On hover, the card''s background animates seamlessly to solid black (`#0a0a0a`), text switches to white (`#fbfbfb`), descriptions shift to `opacity: 0.6`, and the dashed line color lights up.

---

### 4.3. Expertise Section (Section 02)
* **Header**: Large display title "Expertise" paired with section tag `02 / Services`.
* **List Layout**: Stacked vertical list of rows. Every service row has a grid layout: `grid-template-columns: 0.5fr 2fr 4fr 2.5fr`.
* **Columns in Row**:
  * Column 1: Monospaced number indicator (e.g. `01`, `02`).
  * Column 2: Service Title (size `1.8rem`, weight `700`).
  * Column 3: Detailed service description (muted text).
  * Column 4: Right-aligned keyword summary of tool stack (e.g. `Figma, Design Systems`).
* **Row Interaction**: Hovering over a row adds a light background overlay (`rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02)`), shifts the row text `20px` to the right using padding transitions, and shifts the description text to black.

---

### 4.4. About & Experience Section (Section 03)
* **Header**: Large display title "About" paired with section tag `03 / Bio & Career`.
* **Bio Block (Columns 1–2)**: Large typographic paragraph (`font-size: 1.25rem`, line-height `1.6`) detailing the designer''s grid philosophy and client approaches.
* **Experience Timeline (Columns 3–5)**:
  * Stack of chronological roles. Each row uses a grid layout: `grid-template-columns: 2fr 3fr 3fr` (Year range, Role title, Company name).
  * Company names are aligned right, role titles are bold, and years are muted grey.

---

### 4.5. Contact & Footer Section (Section 04)
* **Header**: Large display title "Contact" paired with section tag `04 / Connect`.
* **CTA Block (Columns 1–3)**:
  * Sub-header: "Let''s build something exceptional."
  * Giant email link: `hello@quomi.design` styled in large display font (`font-size: 4vw`, weight `800`) with a bold baseline border. Fades to muted grey on hover.
* **Social Links (Columns 4–5)**: Column list containing social links (e.g., LinkedIn, Dribbble, Twitter/X, Readymag) with clean line-break separation and underline transitions.
* **Footer Bottom Row**: Full width line separator. Features copyright string on the left, and a "Back to top ↑" link on the right that anchors to the top viewport.

---

### 4.6. Fullscreen Navigation Overlay
* A full-viewport layout (`.menu-overlay`) positioned `fixed` with `z-index: 1000` and background color `#fbfbfb`.
* Moves onto the viewport with a translation effect (`transform: translateY(-100%)` to `translateY(0)`) using a custom easing bezier (`cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)`).
* Displays list of links ("Home", "Work", "Expertise", "About", "Contact") in display font, size `4rem`, weight `800`, text-transform `uppercase`. Hovering scales links up by `5%` and shifts color to muted grey.
* Adding the `.no-scroll` class to the body prevents background page scrolling while the overlay is open.

---

## 5. JavaScript Logic Requirements

1. **Dynamic Time Clock**:
   * Runs a function to track the system date and format time string (e.g., `10:41 PM`).
   * Renders the current month and day (e.g., `August 6`).
   * Triggers updates continuously on a `1-minute` timer.
2. **Navigation Overlay Switch**:
   * Toggles the classes `active` on the menu button and navigation overlay when the button is clicked.
   * Prevents page scroll on overlay state changes.
   * Closes the overlay automatically when a link is clicked.

---

## 6. Layout Responsiveness (Media Queries)
The interface maintains visual balance down to small viewports:
* **Large Tablet / Laptop (`max-width: 1200px`)**:
  * Scales down section headings, shrinks project card padding, and decreases minimum card heights.
* **Tablet (`max-width: 1024px`)**:
  * Reduces grid margins to `40px` and collapses project grid columns to `1fr` (cards stack vertically).
  * Hides the tool stack tags in the expertise row to preserve horizontal space.
* **Mobile (`max-width: 768px`)**:
  * Reduces background grid margins to `24px` and limits background lines to `3` columns.
  * Adjusts the info row grid columns into 2 columns, stacking status and profile blocks under the time and location blocks.
  * Adjusts timeline elements to 2 columns and left-aligns company names.
