  '# Web Design Prompt Specification: Zentro Agency Landing Page

Build a premium, high-aesthetic creative agency landing page for "Zentro" using vanilla HTML, vanilla CSS, and vanilla JavaScript. The page features a vibrant background design, ultra-responsive layouts, staggered card deck animations, and a cursor-following interactive services list.

## Global Design Tokens
* **Backgrounds**:
  * Hero Section: Full-screen background image (`url(''https://res.cloudinary.com/z2uss7l7/image/upload/v1786037337/ChatGPT_Image_Aug_6_2026_10_58_31_PM_jbruon.png'')`) with properties: `background-size: cover; background-position: center; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-attachment: fixed;`
  * Content Sections: Semitransparent solid black (`rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.82)`) with a strong backdrop blur effect (`backdrop-filter: blur(15px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(15px);`)
* **Colors**:
  * Text Primary: White (`#ffffff`)
  * Brand Accent: Vibrant Orange-Red (`#ff4b20`)
  * Secondary Overlays: Aesthetic Teal (`#4b717b`), Dark Slate (`#080a0c`)
* **Typography**:
  * Primary: `''Inter''`, sans-serif (Google Fonts, weights 400 to 900)
  * Secondary / Accents: `''Space Grotesk''`, sans-serif (Google Fonts, weights 400 to 700)
* **Global Reset**: `box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0;`

---

## Page Layout & Section Order

### 1. HERO SECTION (CONTAINER)
