  * Center: Copy Year symbol `"©2025"`.
  * Right: Nav action button `"[ Menu ]"` with inline hover opacity transitions.
* **Hero Content Top**:
  * Horizontal layout containing the Title block on the left and the Social link indicator on the right.
  * **Title Section**: Large uppercase typography block: `"IDEAS THAT"`, line break, followed by `"MOVE "` and `"<span class=''italic-title''>BRANDS</span>"` (where italicized segment has font weight 800 and italic styles). Uses `clamp(3.2rem, 5.5vw, 5.5rem)` for fluid scaling.
  * **Social Links Block**: Flex element containing text `"Follow Us"` and a vector share-node icon (`circle` and `line` configurations).
* **Brand Partners**:
  * Inline flex block positioned directly beneath the main hero title:
    * Partner 1: Circular vector icon & `"landestine"`.
    * Partner 2: Vector arrow symbol `"↗"` & `"45 Degrees°"`.
    * Partner 3: Dual overlapping block vectors & `"Codecraft_"`.
* **Hero Content Bottom**:
  * Flex row aligning a giant logo on the left and a stacked card gallery on the right.
  * **Massive Brand Label**: Giant white title `"ZENTRO"` with layout parameters: `font-size: clamp(5.5rem, 14.5vw, 15.5rem); font-weight: 900; line-height: 0.72; letter-spacing: -0.06em; margin-bottom: -1.2rem; margin-left: -0.5rem;`
  * **Card Showcase Gallery**: Horizontal staggered card deck with 4 interactive items:
    * **Card 1 (Teal Silhouette)**: Width wide (`190px`), teal background (`#4b717b`). Contains portrait image styled with `mix-blend-mode: multiply; opacity: 0.9; filter: grayscale(1) contrast(1.2) brightness(0.85);`
    * **Card 2 (Orange Mask)**: Width narrow (`50px`), contains a woman portrait with a tilted horizontal bright red-orange block over the eyes (`height: 15px; background: #ff4500; transform: rotate(-3deg);`).
    * **Card 3 (Dark Slate)**: Width narrow (`50px`), dark background (`#080a0c`), portrait styled with `filter: grayscale(1) contrast(1.4) brightness(0.35);`
    * **Card 4 (Narrow Eye Mask)**: Width narrow (`50px`), contains face profile with a thin red bar over the eye region (`height: 10px; transform: rotate(2deg); background: #ff4500;`).
    * **Card Deck Hover Logic**: Hovering over the gallery deck resets all cards to narrow (`50px`). Hovering directly over any individual card expands its width to wide (`190px`) using `transition: width 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)`.
  * **Floating CTA Button**: Orange-red pill shaped button with hover scaling and magnetic hover physics (`Get For Free →`). Positioned at bottom right of the card gallery (`bottom: 2.2rem; right: -1.5rem;`).
  * **Framer Badge**: White pill-shaped label styled with standard Framer geometry icon next to text `"Made in Framer"`. Positioned at bottom right corner (`bottom: -0.6rem; right: -1.5rem;`).

### 2. ABOUT SECTION ("WHO WE ARE")
* **Layout**: Double column layout using `grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 1fr; gap: 5rem;`
* **Section Header**: Mini index header containing orange serial counter `"01 //"` and title `"WHO WE ARE"`.
* **Left Column**: Uppercase statement headline `"WE ARE A CREATIVE STUDIO BORN AT THE INTERSECTION OF BRAND STRATEGY AND DIGITAL EXPERIENCES."` using fluid font sizes: `clamp(1.8rem, 3.2vw, 3.2rem)`.
* **Right Column**: A description paragraph in Inter (`font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.6; opacity: 0.8;`).
