  * Work 2 (Right Card): Aspect ratio 4/5 (vertically elongated). Contains image `https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531746020798-e6953c6e8e04?q=80&w=800` displaying Aura Labs creative direction.
* **Card Hover Logic**: Hovering over image wrappers displays a dark overlay with a sliding primary orange-red indicator button (`View Project ↗`). The background image scales up smoothly.

