* **Hover Follower Image Interaction**: Hovering over any service item displays a floating follower preview image container (`width: 280px; height: 175px; border-radius: 12px;`). Using JavaScript mousemove tracking, this preview follower image container scales up and tracks the screen coordinates of the cursor smoothly.

### 5. CONTACT & FOOTER SECTION
