    * Giant logo `"ZENTRO"` scales down fluidly using `clamp()` logic to prevent horizontal clipping.
    * Staggered cards lay out in inline cards.
    * Grid structures (About, Works, Services, Footer) reorganize into clean, single-column blocks.',
