  '# Prompt: Recreate "LINIE - Beyond Design" Agency Landing Page

Build a premium, high-fidelity dark-themed creative agency landing page for "LINIE" using HTML5 and Vanilla CSS. The page features a minimal, high-contrast grotesque typography aesthetic with clean lines, smooth animations, and is fully responsive.

---

## Global Requirements

- **Background Color**: Absolute black (`#000000`)
- **Primary Text Color**: Pure white (`#ffffff`)
- **Muted/Secondary Text Color**: Gray (`#8e8e93`)
- **Borders & Dividers**: Thin, transparent borders using `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25)` or `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)`.
- **Typography (Google Fonts)**:
  - **Inter**: Loaded with weights `300;400;500;600;700;800;900` for body copy, buttons, badges, subheaders, and general UI.
  - **Archivo**: Loaded with weight `900` for massive, heavy uppercase headers (such as the main hero title and contact footer CTA).
- **Page Title**: `LINIE - Beyond Design`
- **Main Container**: Spans full width with a responsive padding of `60px` on desktop, scaling down to `40px` on tablets, and `24px` on mobile viewports.

---

## Code Assets & Setup

Ensure the project is set up with three primary files:
1. `index.html` (fully semantic HTML5 structure)
2. `styles.css` (modern CSS with variables, CSS grid/flexbox layouts, hover animations, and custom responsive breakpoints)
3. `package.json` (minimal configuration for running a local Vite server)

---

## Layout Sections

### 1. Navigation Header
A sleek, horizontal bar with a height of `100px` (`80px` on mobile) aligned as a flexbox row with `justify-content: space-between`.
- **Logo (Left)**: An SVG containing three horizontal bars (hamburger style, 20px wide, 10px high, each bar 2px thick) spaced next to bold uppercase text `"LINIE"` followed by a copyright symbol `"©"`.
- **Nav Links (Middle-Right)**:
  - Links: "Case Studies" (with a superscript badge `"15"` next to it), "Services", "About".
  - Font size: `14px`, medium weight, slight transparency (`opacity: 0.85`), transitioning smoothly to full white on hover.
  - Pushed to the right using `margin-left: auto` with a gap of `40px` between links, creating an asymmetrical spacing before the buttons.
- **Header Actions (Far-Right)**:
  - Two pill-shaped buttons: `"Contact"` and `"+ Menu"`.
  - Styling: Thin outline (`1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25)`), border-radius `9999px`, padding `10px 24px`, font size `14px`.
  - Hover interaction: Smoothly transitions to solid white background with black text, scaling up slightly.

---

### 2. Hero Section
An interactive, split-column layout designed to fit the exact viewport screen height (`calc(100vh - 100px)`) on desktop to establish a clean first fold.
- **Section Background Image**: 
  - Image URL: `https://res.cloudinary.com/z2uss7l7/image/upload/v1786040026/ChatGPT_Image_Aug_6_2026_11_43_29_PM_mtjexa.png`
  - Sizing must be set to `contain` with `no-repeat` and `center` alignment so that the entire image remains 100% visible on any screen width without cropping.
- **Left Column**:
  - **Ratings Block**:
    - Overlapping avatars group containing 3 circular images from Unsplash (width/height `36px`, each avatar overlapping with `-12px` left margin, separated by a `2.5px` black border).
    - Ratings info: Five solid bullet indicators (`● ● ● ● ●` with letter-spacing), rating text `"4.9/5"`, and a smaller uppercase caption underneath reading `"BASED ON 180 VERIFIED REVIEWS"` (font-size `9px`, bold, letter-spacing `0.08em`, color `#8e8e93`).
  - **Hero Title**: Massive, double-line header reading `"BEYOND DESIGN"`.
    - Styling: Font family `''Archivo'', sans-serif`, extra bold (`900`), line-height `0.82`, negative letter-spacing `-0.055em`, uppercase, utilizing a responsive sizing clamp: `clamp(4.5rem, 8.5vw, 8.5rem)`.
  - **Action Button**:
    - Black container button with width `360px` and height `64px`, rounded corners (`6px`), solid dark background (`#0b0b0c`), and a subtle border (`1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1)`).
    - Contains text `"START A PROJECT"` (font-size `12px`, letter-spacing `0.1em`, bold) left-aligned, and a clean thin right-arrow SVG inside a flex wrapper on the right.
    - Hover interaction: Slides the arrow rightwards (`translateX(4px)`), deepens background slightly, and brightens the border.
- **Right Column**:
  - **Description**: Sits level with the bottom half of the title. Paragraph text reading `"Turning concepts into experiences that connect, inspire, and endure."`
    - Styling: Regular weight, font-size `20px`, line-height `1.45`, max-width `380px`, left-aligned.
  - **Footer Brands**: Aligned horizontally below the description.
    - **Alt+Shift**: Clean wave SVG path (representing a smooth alternating sine wave) next to the text `"Alt+Shift"`.
    - **Ease**: Open loop SVG path with arrowhead next to the text `"Ease"`.
- **Responsive Stack**: On viewports under `1024px`, the hero section switches to a vertical column layout, height becomes `auto`, and the columns align to the left.

---

### 3. Portfolio Section (Selected Work)
Divided from the hero section by a thin divider line.
- **Section Header**: Flex alignment containing number label `"01 /"` (small, gray, bold) and uppercase title `"Selected Work"`.
- **Portfolio Grid**: 3-column layout on desktop, scaling to 2 columns on tablets, and 1 column on mobile.
  - Each item features:
    - **Project Image**: Inside an aspect-ratio `4:3` container with hidden overflow, rounded corners (`6px`), and a subtle border.
    - **Hover Effect**: Image scales up slightly (`scale(1.05)`) with a slow transition.
    - **Info Row**: Under the image, aligning details (Uppercase Project Title, Sub-category, e.g., `"Brand Identity / Digital Design"`) to the left, and the year (e.g., `"2026"`) to the right.

---

### 4. Services Section
Divided by a thin divider line.
- **Section Header**: Flex alignment containing number label `"02 /"` and uppercase title `"Services"`.
- **Services List**: A vertical stack of capability rows.
  - Each row contains:
    - **Index number**: `"01 /"` (muted gray).
    - **Name**: Bold uppercase service title, e.g., `"BRAND IDENTITY"`.
    - **Description**: Sizable text block explaining the capability.
    - **Indicator (Desktop)**: A clean right-arrow SVG icon.
  - **Hover Animations**: Hovering over a row shifts the entire row background to `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02)`, pads it slightly inwards, shifts the text rightward, and translates the arrow SVG to the right (`translateX(8px)`).
  - **Responsive Stack**: On mobile, the row collapses vertically, hides the arrow indicator, and scales down typography.

---

### 5. About Studio Section
Divided by a thin divider line.
- **Section Header**: Flex alignment containing number label `"03 /"` and uppercase title `"About Studio"`.
- **Ethos Columns (Desktop Split 1.2fr to 1fr)**:
  - **Left Column**: High-impact philosophical headline reading `"We believe in design that is functional, beautiful, and enduring."` in a large, clean, medium-weight font (`clamp(2rem, 3.2vw, 3rem)`).
  - **Right Column**: Descriptive text paragraph about the studio''s focus, followed by a horizontal statistics grid containing:
    - `"12+ Years of Craft"`
    - `"150+ Projects Delivered"`
    - `"4.9 Satisfaction Rating"`
    - Big numbers are styled bold (`40px`), and descriptions are small all-caps gray text.
  - **Responsive Stack**: Collapses to single column on mobile with stacked metrics.

---

### 6. Contact & Footer Section
Divided by a thin divider line.
- **Contact CTA**:
  - A giant clickable link row with subtitle `"Have a project in mind?"` on top, and a massive bold title `"LET''S WORK TOGETHER →"` below.
  - Title styled with Archivo font, size `clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5.8rem)`, uppercase, with a hover effect translating the arrow (`translateX(16px)`).
- **Footer Links Grid**:
  - **Column 1 (Inquiries)**: Clickable contact details (`hello@linie.design` and phone number).
  - **Column 2 (Office)**: Address lines (`Oranienburger Str. 27`, `10117 Berlin, Germany`).
  - **Column 3 (Social)**: Links to social directories (`Instagram`, `LinkedIn`, `Twitter`, `Dribbble`).
- **Footer Bottom Bar**:
  - Left: Copyright notice `"© 2026 LINIE. All rights reserved."`
  - Right: Policy links (`Privacy Policy`, `Terms of Service`) with smooth opacity hover transitions.
  - Collapses to a single-column block on mobile viewports.

