  'https://pub-6e6682d5b928477ab40c1873a1345ec5.r2.dev/videos/1786049524468-gd2aksm.mp4',
  'Build a premium editorial-style portfolio landing page for "Elian Kent" (Certified Framer Pro Expert) using clean HTML5, vanilla CSS, and Vite. The design must copy the exact layout, grid system, typography, and sections from the reference image, with smooth scroll navigation and full-screen layouts.

GLOBAL SETTINGS
- Background color: Pure black (#000000) on html, body, and all page elements.
- Fonts: Load "Space Grotesk" (weights 400, 500, 700, 900) for headings/ui and "Space Mono" (weights 400, 700) for metadata/labels/paragraphs from Google Fonts.
- Scroll Behavior: Smooth scroll (scroll-behavior: smooth).
- Global resets: box-sizing border-box, margin 0, padding 0. Remove scrollbars from x-axis and allow vertical scrolling.
- Responsive design: Desktop has a fixed-height layout where sections represent screen heights, scaling down gracefully using fluid sizing (vw, vh, clamp). On mobile/tablet screens (<768px), layout divs stack vertically into a single-column scrollable feed.

GRID SYSTEM (LINES & CORNER PLUSES)
- Layout Grid: A centered layout container with a width of calc(100% - 80px) and a max-width of 1600px, leaving a fixed 40px margin on both sides of the screen.
- Vertical Lines: 5 thin vertical lines (#1a1a1a) running continuously from the top header to the bottom of the page at 0%, 25%, 50%, 75%, and 100% of the container width.
- Horizontal Lines:
  - Header Divider: A line at top: 80px stretching across the container (0% to 100%).
  - Bottom-Left Divider: Two line segments at bottom: 100px and bottom: 40px spanning only Column 1 (0% to 25%).
  - Section Dividers: A horizontal line separating each subsequent section.
  - Footer Divider: A horizontal line at the very bottom of the page.
- Grid Intersections (+): Recreate the blueprint look by placing small white "+" characters centered exactly on the intersections:
  - Header line at 0% (left) and 100% (right).
  - Bottom-left box corners (0% and 25% at both horizontal lines).
  - Every subsequent section boundary at 0%, 25%, 75%, and 100% marks.
  - Footer bottom corners (0% and 100%).

HEADER SECTION
- Height: 80px, absolute-positioned at the top of the container.
- Column 1 (0% to 25%): Contains Logo. Uses a custom white SVG icon made of two parallel diagonal capsules rotated at -45 degrees (offset by 8px). To its right, "ELIAN KENT" in two lines (Space Grotesk, font-weight 900, uppercase, font-size 11px, line-height 1.1).
- Columns 2 & 3 Centered (25% to 75%): Navigation menu containing "HOME", "ABOUT", "WORKS", "BLOGS", and "CONTACT" in uppercase, size 11px, weight 500, spacing 40px, color #888888. Hover transitions to white (#ffffff) over 0.3s.
- Column 4 (75% to 100%): "BOOK A CALL →" link. Flexbox space-between, text on the left, arrow on the far-right (touches the 100% vertical line). Space Mono, size 12px. On hover, arrow shifts right by 4px.

1. HERO SECTION
- Height: Occupies the remaining viewport space (calc(100vh - 80px)) with margin-top: 80px.
- Background Image: Hero section background contains the image URL:
  https://res.cloudinary.com/z2uss7l7/image/upload/v1786037955/ChatGPT_Image_Aug_6_2026_11_09_00_PM_rihr3e.png
  Set background-size: contain, background-position: center, background-repeat: no-repeat. The image must remain fully visible and fit the screen without any parts getting cropped.
- Big Heading (ELIAN): Spans Columns 1 & 2 (left: 0, top: 10vh). Big bold title "ELIAN" in Space Grotesk, size 16.5vw, font-weight 900, line-height 0.75, letter-spacing -0.065em, uppercase.
- Big Heading (KENT): Spans Columns 3 & 4 (left: 50%, top: 45vh). Big bold title "KENT", same styling. Creates a staggered offset text layout.
- Description (Column 4 Upper, 75% to 100%): Uppercase, right-aligned, monospaced (Space Mono) text at top: 33vh, right: 24px, width: calc(25% - 48px). Text: "I CREATE DIGITAL EXPERIENCES THAT FEEL EFFORTLESS TO USE AND POWERFUL IN IMPACT. FRAMER SITES THAT HELP MODERN BRANDS GROW WITH CLARITY AND CONFIDENCE" (color #a0a0a0, font size 11px, line-height 1.7).
- Certified Box (Column 1 Bottom, 0% to 25%): A bordered container at bottom: 40px, height 60px. Left-aligned custom Framer SVG logo in white. Next to it, text "CERTIFIED PRO EXPERT" in Space Mono, size 10.5px, weight 700, color #888888.

2. ABOUT SECTION
- Height: Min-height 100vh, flex row layout, aligned to vertical grid lines.
- Column 1 (0% to 25%): Displays metadata index "01 / ABOUT" in Space Mono, weight 700, size 11px, color #888888.
- Columns 2 & 3 (25% to 75%): Main editorial copy. Heading "CRAFTING DIGITAL EXPERIENCES WITH STRATEGY & INTENT" (Space Grotesk, size 2.8vw, uppercase, weight 700, margin-bottom 30px). Body paragraph in Space Grotesk (size 15px, color #a0a0a0, line-height 1.7) detailing designer bio and design strategy.
- Column 4 (75% to 100%): Sidebar list detailing Role (PRODUCT DESIGNER / 3D ARTIST), Location (BANGALORE, INDIA), and Expert status (FRAMER EXPERT (PARTNER)) in stacked labels and values.

3. WORKS SECTION
- Height: Min-height 100vh, showing case studies.
- Column 1 (0% to 25%): Displays metadata index "02 / WORKS".
- Columns 2, 3 & 4 (25% to 100%): Spans full remaining width with big horizontal list items:
  - Row 1: VEON -- Description: "MINIMAL E-COMMERCE & CLOTHING BRAND PLATFORM", Type: "E-COMMERCE / DESIGN", Year: "2026", Index: "01/".
  - Row 2: GLIDEX -- Description: "BENTO-STYLE VIDEO & FILM PORTFOLIO FOR CREATIVES", Type: "VIDEO PORTFOLIO / WEB", Year: "2025", Index: "02/".
  - Row 3: SIENNA -- Description: "PHOTOGRAPHY & CREATIVE STUDIO AUDIOVISUAL GALLERY", Type: "PHOTOGRAPHY / EXPERIMENTAL", Year: "2025", Index: "03/".
  Each project item has a border-top, flexbox layout, and transitions on hover (shifting text left, light bg color tint).

4. BLOGS SECTION
- Height: Min-height 100vh.
- Column 1 (0% to 25%): Displays metadata index "03 / BLOGS".
- Columns 2 & 3 (25% to 75%): Main article card -- "DESIGNING WITH INTENT: WHY CLARITY BEATS COMPLEXITY IN MODERN UI" (Date: AUG 2026, Read Time: 5 MIN, includes custom excerpt and "READ ARTICLE →" link).
- Column 4 (75% to 100%): Sidebar mini article card -- "THE SILENT HAND OF VISUAL HIERARCHY IN E-COMMERCE" (Date: JUL 2026, Read Time: 4 MIN, includes excerpt and "READ ARTICLE →" link).
  Cards feature thin gray borders, subtle hover scaling, and background color shifts.

5. CONTACT SECTION
- Height: Min-height 100vh.
- Column 1 (0% to 25%): Displays metadata index "04 / CONTACT".
- Columns 2 & 3 (25% to 75%): Huge CTA heading -- "LET''S BUILD SOMETHING EXTRAORDINARY" (Space Grotesk, size 3.5vw, weight 900, uppercase). Email link hello@eliankent.com styled with a bottom border and hover fade transition.
- Column 4 (75% to 100%): List of social links (TWITTER / X, DRIBBBLE, LINKEDIN, FRAMER PROFILE) in Space Mono, uppercase. Includes a bottom footer line and endpoints.',
