  '# Premium FUEL® Landing Page Specification

Build a high-performance, single-page creative studio portfolio landing page for "FUEL®" utilizing semantic HTML5, Vanilla CSS, and custom JavaScript. The page features a luxurious dark aesthetic, high-contrast glassmorphism card layouts, interactive elements, custom scroll triggers, and a moving holographic pastel gradient.

## Global Styles & Tokens
* **Backgrounds & Themes**: Deep black `#000000` base. Accent glassmorphic cards use `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025)` backgrounds with thin `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)` borders and `backdrop-filter: blur(20px)`.
* **Typography**: Primary body font is ''Plus Jakarta Sans'', and heading display font is ''Space Grotesk'' (Google Fonts).
* **Color Palette**: Highlights use a moving multi-stop pastel aurora gradient (`linear-gradient(90deg, #ffffff, #e2e8f0, #e0f2fe, #fce7f3, #fee2e2, #e0f2fe, #ffffff)`).

---

## Page Structure & Sections

### 1. Hero Section
* **Viewport Setup**: Exactly `100vh` absolute vertical layout.
* **Top Header**: Contains:
  * **Logo Container**: Features a grid logo mark (three 6px squares in a custom pattern) next to the bold display text "FUEL®".
  * **Nav Links**: "Home 01", "Portfolio 02", "About 03", and "Contact 04".
  * **Meet the CEO Badge**: A white compact floating card (`#ffffff`) containing a grayscale profile avatar, names, roles, and a top-right structural SVG corner indicator.
* **Left Panel**: 
  * Features the description paragraph text including Japanese characters: `"Pick a plan, submit a job request, and your イメージ will kickoff within 24 hours."`
  * Includes a custom underlined `Explore Now` hover link with an arrow SVG icon.
  * A vertical services stack matching the selection highlights: `01/ Strategy` (active), `Videography`, and `Branding`.
* **Foreground Anchor Text**: A massive display title "FUEL X" using `Space Grotesk` at `17vw` with clipping applied to the animated holographic gradient.
* **Hero Background**: Fits the background URL `https://res.cloudinary.com/z2uss7l7/image/upload/v1786114847/ChatGPT_Image_Aug_7_2026_08_30_08_PM_si9d4z.png` exactly to the boundaries of the hero section container using `100% 100%` stretching.
* **Hero Footer**: Features a bottom-left custom ruler widget highlighting the copyright year `© 2025`, a set of thin vertical tick lines (varying heights), and a scale value of `19''`.

### 2. Selected Works (Portfolio)
* **Interactive Filter**: Four clickable tabs: `All Projects` (default), `Strategy`, `Videography`, and `Branding`.
* **Grid Cards**: A 2-column layout showing cards that dynamically scale up on hover. Each card contains a category tag, client names, metrics (e.g. `+340% Conversion`), descriptions, and links.
* **Unsplash Assets**: Loaded from reliable high-res URLs:
  * Project 1: `https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618005182384-a83a8bd57fbe` (Branding)
  * Project 2: `https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1492691527719-9d1e07e534b4` (Videography)
  * Project 3: `https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507679799987-c73779587ccf` (Strategy)
  * Project 4: `https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1634017839464-5c339ebe3cb4` (Branding)

### 3. Capabilities & Process
* **Capabilities Accordion**: A 3-tier vertical stack where clicking headers rotates the `+` sign and expands internal detail paragraphs containing styling labels.
* **Kickoff Blueprint**: A sidebar process card presenting a 3-step timeline (`STEP 01` to `STEP 03`) using clean tags and descriptions.

### 4. Executive Vision
* **Vision Quote**: Large-scale quote layout by CEO Louisiana KD6 highlighting the overhead-free 24-hour sprint model.
* **Metrics Board**: A 4-box stats layout highlighting numbers (`150+`, `24h`, `99.4%`, `12`) rendered using the holographic gradient.

### 5. Plans & Kickoff CTA
* **Plan Switcher**: A billing slider toggle with transition logic and a green indicator badge showcasing "Save 20%".
* **Subscription Tiers**: Three distinct packages (Sprint, Agency FUEL X, and Enterprise Custom) detailing pricing, features, and call-to-action buttons.
* **Quick Request Form**: A layout containing text fields, a category dropdown selector, and a submit button that transitions on successful submission.

---

## Client Interactions & Micro-Animations
* **Scroll-Triggered Reveal**: Uses an `IntersectionObserver` in JavaScript to fade-in and slide-up elements as they enter the viewport.
* **Portfolio Filtering**: Instant transition mapping to filter categories and hide or display project items using CSS transformations.
* **Accordion Mechanics**: Calculates `scrollHeight` in JavaScript to animate the accordion container wrapper height.
* **Form Feedback**: Dynamic text update and validation animation upon submission.',
