  '# Prompt: Build Treq - Premium Design Studio Landing Page

Build a premium, high-converting dark-theme landing page for "Treq" (Design Agency) using HTML5, Vanilla CSS3, and Vanilla JavaScript (ES6+). The website has a dark aesthetic, custom typography, infinite marquees, animated numeric stats counters, an interactive billing toggle, sliders, and accordions.

## Global Specifications
- **Background Color**: `#000000` (pure black)
- **Primary Text Color**: `#ffffff` (white)
- **Secondary Text Color**: `#757b89` (dark grey)
- **Light Grey/Subtext Color**: `#c8cbd0`
- **Accent Red Color**: `#ff3b30` (accent red for badges, metrics, and select hover/active states)
- **Card Backgrounds**: `#121416` (primary card bg) and `#1c1d21` (secondary card bg)
- **Border Colors**: `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)` (subtle divider borders) and `rgb(47, 49, 55)` (card borders)
- **Typography (Google Fonts)**:
  - Font Family Primary: `''Host Grotesk''`, sans-serif (weights 500, 600, 700, 800)
  - Font Family Secondary: `''Inter''`, sans-serif (weights 400, 700, 900)
  - Font Family Tertiary: `''DM Sans''`, sans-serif (weights 500, 700)
- **Viewport Layout**: Full responsiveness scaling smoothly from mobile (320px) to ultra-wide (1440px+).

---

## File Structure & Dependencies
Deliver the codebase across 4 separate files:
1. `index.html` (Semantic markup and configuration)
2. `style.css` (Premium design tokens, layout styling, scroll animations, media queries)
3. `script.js` (Stat counter animations, accordions, carousel, billing selector)
4. `package.json` (Configuration to support development using Vite)

---

## Component Details & Layout

### 1. Navigation Bar (Header)
- **Layout**: Flexbox container (`justify-between`, `align-items: center`) absolute-positioned at the top of the viewport.
- **Left**: Clickable logo text "TREQ®" (uppercase, bold, font size `20px`).
- **Right**: Action link "HIRE US" pointing to `#pricing` (uppercase, bold, font size `14px`, transitions opacity to `70%` on hover).
- **Padding**: `32px 40px` (desktop), `24px` (mobile). Maximum width bounds: `1440px`.

### 2. Hero Section
- **Layout**: Fits the viewport height exactly (`height: 100vh`). Replaces traditional absolute flex columns with a 2-column, 3-row grid layout on desktop:
  - Grid Columns: `1fr 1fr`
  - Grid Rows: `1fr auto auto`
  - Grid Areas mapping:
    - Row 1: `viewfinder` (Left) | `empty` (Right)
    - Row 2: `subtext` (Left) | `badge` (Right)
    - Row 3: `title` (Left) | `desc` (Right)
  - Column Gap: `80px`, Row Gap: `20px`.
  - Background Image: Hero background is the image `https://res.cloudinary.com/z2uss7l7/image/upload/v1786116084/ChatGPT_Image_Aug_7_2026_08_51_00_PM_o6t27u.png` set to `background-size: cover`, `background-position: center`, and `background-repeat: no-repeat`.
- **Viewfinder (Row 1 Left)**:
  - A camera viewfinder styled container with `aspect-ratio: 16/10`, restricted to `max-height: 280px`.
  - Center is completely transparent, allowing the section''s background image to be fully visible.
  - Four absolute-positioned corner brackets (`┌`, `┐`, `└`, `┘`) in thin borders (`1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4)`), spaced with `16px` padding inside the viewfinder bounds.
- **Empty Space (Row 1 Right)**: Completely empty cell to keep the top right side blank.
- **Hero Subtext (Row 2 Left)**: Paragraph text "The first design studio built for speed", aligned vertically to the bottom of the viewfinder cell. Font size `14px`, color white, `80%` opacity.
- **Focus Badge (Row 2 Right)**: Aligned horizontally with the subtext on the left. Text: `[ F A S T   I S   O U R   F O C U S ]` in monospaced, wide-tracked capital letters.
- **Hero Title (Row 3 Left)**: A massive `<h1>` header block containing two vertical spans: "VISUALS" and "UNBOXED". Uppercase, bold, font size `clamp(48px, 5.5vw, 96px)`, line-height `0.9`, letter-spacing `-0.04em`.
- **Hero Description (Row 3 Right)**: Aligned horizontally with the bottom title. Paragraph: "Fast, precise, and seamless—digital products and visuals delivered with uncompromising quality. From sleek designs to high-impact assets, execution is swift and flawless." Font size `clamp(14px, 1.2vw, 18px)`, color light-grey, maximum width limit `480px`.

### 3. About Section
- **Divider**: A thin top horizontal border (`1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)`) with vertical spacing (`80px` margin) divides the section.
- **Layout**: Column flex container with vertical gap `64px`.
- **Header Grid**: Split into 2 columns:
  - Left: "EST. 2012" in uppercase bold text.
  - Right: A descriptive paragraph "It started from a backyard in Alabama with photoshop cs6... shipping visual on times square billboards." (Font size `20px`, line-height `1.5`, color light-grey).
