## Interactive Script Logic (`script.js`)

### 1. Animated Stats Counter
Utilizes `IntersectionObserver` to detect when the stats cards enter the viewport:
- Coordinates the counting animation of target digits from `0` to target values (`80`, `2`, `300`).
- Applies a smooth cubic ease-out curve (`1 - Math.pow(1 - progress, 3)`) over a duration of `1200ms` at `60fps`.
- Safely updates text contents using the respective prefix/suffix (`+`, ` HRS`).

### 2. Billing Toggle Switch
Controls pricing plans:
- Intercepts clicks on "Yearly" and "Monthly" pill controls.
- Toggles the `active` styling classes.
- Accesses pricing figures using HTML data attributes (`data-yearly`, `data-monthly`) and updates pricing/period nodes in the DOM.

### 3. FAQ Accordion Expanding
Controls collapsible accordion panels:
- Adds click event listeners to accordion header trigger buttons.
- Collapses other open accordions.
- Sets the `maxHeight` property of the clicked accordion content panel to its `scrollHeight` (for smooth CSS transition rendering) and toggles the `active` rotation class on the expand indicator icon.

### 4. Portfolio Image Sliders
Powers the portfolio slideshows:
- Tracks the active image index for each showcase card carousel.
- Slides the `.slider-track` container by adjusting the CSS `transform` value (`translateX(-[index * 20]%)`) upon arrow button trigger clicks.',
