INSERT INTO public.templates (title, category, type, image, video, prompt, likes, published, position)
VALUES (
  'Glass Showcase',
  'UI Components',
  'Premium',
  '',
  'https://pub-6e6682d5b928477ab40c1873a1345ec5.r2.dev/videos/1786210771627-ieq3bus.mp4',
  '# Glass Showcase System Prompt

Build a premium, highly interactive **Glass Showcase** landing page with an accordion hover effect, dynamic background crossfades, and full keyboard accessibility. The project must be structured using standard HTML5, Vanilla CSS, and Vanilla JavaScript.

## TECH STACK & CONFIGURATION
- **Structure**: Semantic HTML5 (`index.html`)
- **Styling**: Vanilla CSS (`style.css`)
- **Logic**: Vanilla JavaScript (`app.js`)
- **Build/Dev Tool**: Vite (optional, supports instant HMR and static file hosting)
- **Typography**: Google Font "Inter" (weights 500, 600)

---

## GLOBAL STYLES
- **Background**: Deep rich dark gray/black background `#070708` on html, body, and background layer.
- **Font Family**: `''Inter'', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif`.
- **Global Reset**: `box-sizing: border-box`, `margin: 0`, `padding: 0`.
- **Performance**: High-performance scrolling and transitions using `will-change: transform, opacity`.
- **Scrollbar**: Custom thin scrollbars or hidden overflow on the outer body to keep a fullscreen presentation.

---

## CORE PAGE STRUCTURE & SECTIONS

### 1. DYNAMIC BACKGROUND LAYER (`.showcase-bg`)
A full-screen, absolute-positioned slide system that acts as the global background.
- **Sizing**: `position: fixed; inset: 0; width: 100vw; height: 100vh; overflow: hidden; z-index: 1;`
- **Slides**: Contains 6 absolute-positioned slides (`.bg-slide`):
  - **Slide 0 (Default)**: Image URL `https://framerusercontent.com/images/XBlakPLkiAesoiWyT9SwAgf1H4.png?width=1200`
  - **Slide 1**: Image URL `https://framerusercontent.com/images/gSsz1qPZQytnn6t43kjGjJwnkk.jpg?width=1200`
  - **Slide 2**: Image URL `https://framerusercontent.com/images/EADacE6QTEhnzYUEGRnEiqI633k.jpg?width=1200`
  - **Slide 3**: Image URL `https://framerusercontent.com/images/RZGdxPgP4K65ZfnSOVgAzAEQmaY.png?width=1200`
  - **Slide 4**: Image URL `https://framerusercontent.com/images/n93fhADLZgsg09EW1G6wxXzeXKs.jpg?width=1200`
  - **Slide 5**: Image URL `https://framerusercontent.com/images/ThlH4LgitAohoQZ0MIfH6BSQA6E.png?width=1200`
- **Animation States**:
  - **Inactive state**: `opacity: 0`, `transform: scale(1.1)`.
  - **Active state (`.active`)**: `opacity: 1`, `transform: scale(1)`.
  - **Transitions**: Smooth crossfade transition: `opacity 0.4s ease-in-out` combined with spring-like scale transition: `transform 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)`.
- **Overlay**: An absolute-positioned dark overlay (`.bg-overlay`) placed on top of all slides: `background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35); z-index: 3`.

### 2. MAIN CARD WRAPPER & CONTAINER (`.showcase-wrapper`)
- **Wrapper**: Flexbox container centering the showcase on the screen: `min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 24px; z-index: 10`.
- **Glassmorphic Card (`.showcase-card`)**:
  - **Sizing**: `width: 100%; max-width: 757px; height: auto; border-radius: 16px; padding: 12px; overflow: hidden;`
  - **Glassmorphism**: `background: rgba(20, 20, 20, 0.22); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); backdrop-filter: blur(19px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(19px);`
  - **Visuals**: Premium soft drop shadow: `box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)`.
  - **Mount Animation**: Translates up and fades in on page mount: `transform: translateY(20px); opacity: 0; animation: mountCard 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards`.

---

## INTERACTIVE ACCORDION LIST (`.showcase-list`)
The card container houses a vertical list (`.showcase-list`) of 5 button items. Each item represents a brand showcase.

### 1. Item Container (`.showcase-item`)
- **Elements**: HTML `<button type="button" class="showcase-item" data-index="[0-4]">`.
- **Sizing**: `width: 100%; height: 80px; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;`
- **Default State**: `background: transparent; border: none; cursor: pointer; text-align: left;`
- **Hover/Focused State (`:hover`, `.focused`)**:
  - **Background**: Turns white/opaque: `background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);`
  - **Height**: Expands to `120px` to reveal hidden text.
  - **Transitions**: Replicates a spring animation using `transition: background-color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), height 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);`.

### 2. Item Inner Elements & Layout

#### Flex Layout (`.item-content`)
- **Structure**: Horizontal layout containing the thumbnail wrapper and text wrapper: `display: flex; gap: 12px; width: 100%; height: 100%;`
- **State Transition**: `align-items: center` in default collapsed state. When hovered or focused, transitions to `align-items: flex-start` using `transition: align-items 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);`.

#### Thumbnail Image (`.thumbnail-wrapper`)
- **Structure**: Div wrapper surrounding an image.
- **Sizing**:
  - **Width**: Locked at `110px` (flex-shrink: 0).
  - **Height (Collapsed)**: `64px`.
  - **Height (Hovered/Focused)**: Expands to `104px`.
  - **Transition**: `height 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)`.
- **Image**: `width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 12px;`.

#### Text Content (`.text-wrapper`)
- **Structure**: Absolute positioned container relative to parent item: `flex: 1; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; position: relative; height: 64px;`
- **Sizing**: Transitions `height` from `64px` to `104px` and adds `padding-top: 8px` on hover/focus.

#### Paginated Index (`.pagination`)
- **Structure**: Positioned in top-right corner of the text area: `position: absolute; top: 8px; right: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);`
- **Visibility**:
  - **Default**: Hidden (`opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-5px)`).
  - **Hovered/Focused**: Fades in and slides down: `opacity: 0.55; transform: translateY(0);`.
  - **Transition**: `opacity 0.2s ease, transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)`.

#### Item Title (`.item-title`)
- **Styling**: `font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.01em; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;`
- **Colors**:
  - **Default**: Off-white: `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9)`.
  - **Hovered/Focused**: Solid black: `#000000`.
  - **Transition**: `color 0.2s ease`.

#### Item Description (`.item-description`)
- **Styling**: `font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.4; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7); display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 3; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; word-wrap: break-word;`
- **Visibility**:
  - **Default**: `opacity: 0; max-height: 0; margin-top: 0; overflow: hidden;`
  - **Hovered/Focused**: Fades and expands in height: `opacity: 1; max-height: 80px; margin-top: 10px;`
  - **Transition**: `opacity 0.2s ease, max-height 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), margin-top 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)`.

---

## BRAND DATA
1. **Northpeak** (Index: 0, Paginated: `01 / 05`):
   - Thumbnail: `https://framerusercontent.com/images/gSsz1qPZQytnn6t43kjGjJwnkk.jpg?width=200`
   - Description: `Minimal forms, strong typography, and refined details create a timeless system designed for forward-thinking brands, creative studios, and premium digital experiences.`
2. **Studio K** (Index: 1, Paginated: `02 / 05`):
   - Thumbnail: `https://framerusercontent.com/images/EADacE6QTEhnzYUEGRnEiqI633k.jpg?width=200`
   - Description: `Experimental visuals, bold direction, and contemporary aesthetics crafted for brands that want to stand out with confidence and personality.`
3. **Arcade** (Index: 2, Paginated: `03 / 05`):
   - Thumbnail: `https://framerusercontent.com/images/RZGdxPgP4K65ZfnSOVgAzAEQmaY.png?width=200`
   - Description: `A clean and playful visual approach inspired by digital culture, combining soft minimalism with interactive modern design elements.`
4. **Lumen** (Index: 3, Paginated: `04 / 05`):
   - Thumbnail: `https://framerusercontent.com/images/n93fhADLZgsg09EW1G6wxXzeXKs.jpg?width=200`
   - Description: `Atmospheric visuals and subtle motion language focused on light, depth, and immersive storytelling for modern creative projects.`
5. **Kairo** (Index: 4, Paginated: `05 / 05`):
   - Thumbnail: `https://framerusercontent.com/images/ThlH4LgitAohoQZ0MIfH6BSQA6E.png?width=200`
   - Description: `Structured grids and modern visual rhythm combined with subtle interactions to create a premium and timeless digital presence.`

---

## INTERACTION & BEHAVIORAL LOGIC (`app.js`)

### 1. Hover Interactions
- **Action**: Hovering over any `.showcase-item` button triggers the `.focused` CSS class on that element, and sets the active state on the global background slideshow matching that item''s index (`index + 1`).
- **Reset**: When the pointer leaves the list container, if there is no active keyboard index set, the global background reverts to the default background slide (index `0`).

### 2. Focus & Keyboard Accessibility
- **Key Navigation**:
  - `ArrowDown`: Navigates to the next list item, applying focus, adding `.focused` class, scrolling the element into view smoothly (`scrollIntoView({ behavior: ''smooth'', block: ''nearest'' })`), and crossfading the background. Wraps around from index 4 to 0.
  - `ArrowUp`: Navigates to the previous list item, with the same behaviors. Wraps around from index 0 to 4.
  - `Escape`: Resets the active states: collapses any expanded item, reverts the global background to the default slide, and blurs any active focus.
- **Aria Management**: Keeps `aria-current="true"` on the currently focused item and `aria-current="false"` on others.

---

## RESPONSIVE BREAKPOINTS
Use a mobile-first approach with custom CSS breakpoints.
- **Mobile (< 768px)**:
  - Showcase wrapper padding reduces to `16px`.
  - Item height collapses to `72px` (from `80px`) and expands to `104px` (from `120px`) on hover/focus.
  - Thumbnail wrapper collapses to `90px` width and `56px` height; expands to `88px` height on hover/focus.
  - Text wrapper height collapses to `56px` and expands to `88px`.
  - Font sizes decrease: Title goes down to `16px`, description goes to `12px` and is clamped to a maximum of 2 lines.
  - Paginated indices (`01 / 05`) are hidden to preserve screen real estate.',
