  'Build a premium "Expand OnHover List" interactive showcase page using HTML, Vanilla CSS, and lightweight Vanilla JavaScript. The page features a clean, minimal design with smooth, GPU-accelerated spring animations, 3D graphic reveal, and selective sibling dimming.

GLOBAL STYLES
Background: html and body have a light gray background (#f5f5f7), display flex, centered.
Font family: 
- Headings: ''PT Sans Narrow'', sans-serif (Google Fonts, weight 700)
- Numbers & Body Copy: ''Inter'', sans-serif (Google Fonts, weights 400, 500, 600)
Global reset: border-box sizing, margin 0, padding 0.
Layout wrapper: A centered container with max-width of 820px and flex column layout.

LAYOUT STRUCTURE
1. Showcase Wrapper: Max-width 820px, flex direction column, gap 30px.
2. Header Section: Centered text with max-width 650px:
   - Badge: Small text "INTERACTIVE COMPONENT", uppercase, letter-spacing 0.12em, font size 11px, weight 600, background rgba(0,0,0,0.04), padding 6px 14px, rounded-full.
   - Title: H1 text "Expand OnHover List", font ''Inter'', size 30px, weight 600, tracking-tight, color #000000.
   - Subtitle: Paragraph text describing the component, size 16px, line-height 1.5, color #9e9e9e.
3. List Card: A container card for the list:
   - Background #ffffff, border-radius 20px, padding 32px 48px.
   - Shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.03), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.02).

LIST COMPONENT & ITEMS
A vertical list (.expand-list) with 3 interactive items, bordered by a top line (1px solid #e5e5e5).

Each list item (.list-item) has:
- A bottom border (1px solid #e5e5e5) that transitions to dark black (#000000) when active or hovered.
- Padding: 18px 0 (collapsed) which expands to 28px 0 (active/hovered) using a spring cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) transition.
- Layout: flex-row, items aligned center, justify-between, gap 24px.

Item columns (left-to-right):
1. Number: e.g., "01", "02", "03" in ''Inter'' font, size 18px, weight 500, color #9e9e9e, min-width 40px. Transitions to color #000000 on hover.
2. Details: flex-grow layout containing title and expandable description:
   - Title: e.g., "EMAIL MARKETING", "LIFECYCLE CAMPAIGNS", "CUSTOMER OUTREACH" in ''PT Sans Narrow'', size 22px, weight 700, tracking-wider, uppercase, color #9e9e9e. Transitions to color #000000 on hover.
   - Expandable Description: A wrapper with grid-template-rows transition (0fr when collapsed, 1fr when active/hovered) containing an inner overflow-hidden container. Description text is ''Inter'', size 13.5px, line-height 1.5, color #4a4a4a, padding-top 6px. Opacity transitions from 0 to 1, and translateY from -6px to 0px on expansion.
3. Image Card: Hidden/collapsed by default, expands and tilts on hover:
   - Wrapper: width 0, opacity 0, scale 0.9, rotate 0deg. Transitions to width 180px, opacity 1, scale 1, rotate -3.5deg on active/hovered. Uses spring easing: cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1).
   - Card: width 160px, height 96px, border-radius 12px, border 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06), background #fafafa, shadow 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.04), overflow hidden.
   - Images (illustrations):
     * Item 01: 3D render of a glassy blue envelope icon
     * Item 02: 3D render of a glassy blue target with center arrow icon
     * Item 03: 3D render of a glassy blue megaphone icon
4. CTA Button: A black circular button with white arrow vector:
   - Button: diameter 36px, background #000000, color #ffffff, border-radius 50%, flex center.
   - SVG inside: width 16px, height 16px, line width 2.5px.
   - Hover state: rotates counter-clockwise by -45deg and scales up to 1.05 using the spring bezier transition.

INTERACTION LOGIC & TRANSITIONS
1. Sibling Dimming: When the cursor hovers over any list item, all other items in the list instantly fade to 0.35 opacity. Built using CSS selector `.expand-list:hover .list-item:not(:hover)`.
2. Mobile / Touch Support: A lightweight JavaScript click handler toggles the `.active` class on list items. Tapping an item expands it, dims all other items, and clicking outside collapses all active items.
3. Spring Curves: All layout transformations (padding, grid rows, wrapper width, tilts) use a GPU-accelerated transition of `0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)`.

RESPONSIVE BREAKPOINTS
Mobile (< 768px):
- Component max-width scales down, and main card padding reduces to 32px 24px.
- Heading sizes scale down (H1 to 30px, item titles to 24px).
- Image Card column collapses (width 0, opacity 0) to maintain a vertical stacking layout.',
