  '# Folder Stack Interactive Layout - System Specification & Build Prompt

Build a high-performance, responsive **Folder Stack** interactive portfolio container with dynamic image cards popping out on hover. The page features a smooth two-column grid layout on desktop, merging into a single column stack on mobile, and offers a selector toggle to switch between a **Default** fanning animation and a **3D tilt opening** animation.

