## GLOBAL STYLES & LAYOUT
- **Fonts**: Load ''Inter'', ''Instrument Sans'', and ''Hubot Sans'' from Google Fonts.
  - `Inter` for general layout UI.
  - `Instrument Sans` for the bold folder title labels.
  - `Hubot Sans` for numerical indicators.
- **Background**: Fixed fullscreen mesh backdrop gradient image: `https://framerusercontent.com/images/crQ75wc8A0wqgMXOm83xYK8Qk4.png` with size `cover` and position `center`.
- **Main Container**: Centered flex column with `width: 100%`, `max-width: 720px`, and gap `32px`.
- **CSS Transitions**: Smooth animations for all transformations using `cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1)` with a duration of `0.4s`.

---

## SECTION 1: VARIANT SELECTOR TOGGLE
A pill-shaped button group centered at the top of the container:
- **Container Structure**: A container with a semi-transparent white background (`rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45)`), `backdrop-filter: blur(8px)`, padding `3px`, border-radius `100px`, and thin border `1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6)`.
- **Options**: Two buttons -- **Default** and **3D Hover**.
  - Buttons have transparent backgrounds, no borders, font-size `13px`, font-weight `600`, padding `6px 14px`, and cursor pointer.
  - Active button text color is `rgb(32, 32, 32)`; inactive button text color is desaturated (`rgba(32, 32, 32, 0.6)`).
- **Active Pill Slider**: A solid white `.toggle-slider` background sits absolute behind the active text, moving dynamically via JavaScript based on the clicked button''s `offsetLeft` and `offsetWidth`.
- **Function**: Toggles the `.mode-3d` class on the parent `.folder-stack` container.

---

## SECTION 2: FOLDER STACK GRID
A wrapping container (`.folder-stack`) displaying folder cards:
- **Layout**: Flexbox with `flex-direction: row` and `flex-wrap: wrap`.
- **Grid Responsiveness**:
  - **Desktop (> 600px)**: Two side-by-side columns. Each card has `flex: 1 1 50%` (stretching to exactly `360px` max-width).
    - Left column houses Folder **01** (motion), **03** (editors), and **05** (illustration).
    - Right column houses Folder **02** (branding), **04** (photoworks), and **06** (trends).
  - **Mobile (<= 600px)**: Wraps into a single vertical column (`flex: 1 1 100%` and `min-width: 260px`).
- **Dimming Effect**: When a card is hovered (`.active`), the stack receives `.has-active`, causing all non-active cards to desaturate (`filter: grayscale(100%)`) and fade slightly (`opacity: 0.9`).

---

## SECTION 3: FOLDER COMPONENT ANATOMY
Each folder (`.folder-item`) contains:

### 1. Images Popout Wrapper (`.images-container-wrapper`)
- Absolute positioned behind the folder card (`z-index: -1`).
- Sits at `top: 36px` (aligning with the bottom of the folder tab) and has a height matching the folder content body.
- Employs a custom clip path: `clip-path: inset(-500% -50% 1px -50%)`. This prevents images from showing underneath the bottom of the folder card while allowing them to slide up freely off the top.
- Includes `transform-style: preserve-3d`.

### 2. Folder Body Card Wrapper (`.folder-body-wrapper`)
- Contains the tab and content box. Uses `transform-origin: bottom center` and `transform-style: preserve-3d`.
- **3D Tilt Animation**: In **3D Hover** mode (`.mode-3d`), the hovered card''s body tilts backward on the X-axis: `transform: rotateX(-30deg)`.

### 3. Slanted Folder Header Tab (`.folder-header`)
- **Folder Tab**: Rectangular header.
  - Border-top-left-radius: `11px`.
  - Padding: `14px 20px 7px 20px`, min-height: `36px`, background-color: folder''s color.
  - Width: dynamically calculated via JS (`label.offsetWidth + 4`) to wrap text tightly.
  - Inside sits a numerical span (`.folder-number`, font-size `12.5px`, font-weight `600`, opacity `0.6`).
- **Folder Slant SVG**: An inline SVG positioned immediately to the right of the tab:
  - Size: `width="18" height="32" viewBox="0 0 18 32"` with `preserveAspectRatio="none"`.
  - Geometry: `<path d="M 0 32 L 18 32 L 0 0 Z" fill="[folder-color]" />`. This draws a matching slant triangle that bridges the tab block and the main folder cover block.

### 4. Folder Content Cover (`.folder-content`)
- Sized `width: 100%`, `min-height: 88px`.
- Background-color: folder''s color.
- Border-radius: `0px 11px 11px 11px` (top-left is `0` where it merges with the slant tab).
- Padding: `4px 20px 48px 20px`.
- Box-shadow: `0px 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05)`.
- Inside sits the lowercase folder label (`.folder-label`, font-size `36px`, font-weight `400`, letter-spacing `-0.05em`, line-height `1.1em`).

