  '# Recreation Prompt - 3D Infinite Canvas Gallery

Build a highly interactive 3D infinite canvas gallery landing page using Vanilla HTML5, CSS3, modern ES6 JavaScript, and Three.js (r160) loaded via a native browser `<script type="importmap">` for a zero-build, modular ESM stack. The app features an unbounded 3D space with a procedurally generated gallery of floating high-resolution floral images, smooth physics-based dragging, camera zoom, keyboard navigation, fog effects, and real-time parameter tweaking.

---

## Global Styles

- **Background Color**: `#000000` (pitch black) on `html`, `body`, and all main containers.
- **Fonts**: 
  - Display typography: `''Outfit''`, sans-serif (Google Fonts)
  - Body/Sans-serif typography: `''Plus Jakarta Sans''`, sans-serif (Google Fonts)
- **Viewport Constraints**: `width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: hidden;` to lock scrolling and viewport resizing.
- **WebGL Container**: An absolute-positioned `#canvas-container` taking up `100vw` and `100vh` with a `z-index: 1`. Cursor defaults to `grab` and transitions to `grabbing` during mouse dragging.

---

## UI Layout & DOM Structure

A set of premium dark glassmorphic panels float on top of the 3D canvas (`z-index: 10`), using backdrop filters (`backdrop-filter: blur(16px)`), thin translucent borders (`rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)`), and dark-tinted backgrounds (`rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.65)`).

1. **Header Panel (Top Left)**:
