  'https://pub-6e6682d5b928477ab40c1873a1345ec5.r2.dev/videos/1786212409056-en7y3pf.mp4',
  'Build a WebGL Liquid Paper-Tear Transition showcase landing page using HTML, CSS (Vanilla), and ES6 JavaScript. The page features a full-screen canvas that displays a top image, and as the user moves their mouse or swipes, it generates a fluid mask that reveals a bottom image with a torn-paper, noise-scattered edge effect. The page also features a floating instructions card in the bottom-left and an interactive control panel dashboard in the top-right to customize all parameters.

GLOBAL STYLES
Background: #07090e
Font family: ''Plus Jakarta Sans'', sans-serif (imported from Google Fonts: weights 300-700)
Global reset: box-sizing border-box, margin 0, padding 0
Main container (#app) is relative, full-width (100%), full-height (100vh), overflow hidden.
