LAYOUT COMPONENTS

1. INSTRUCTIONS CARD
Positioned absolutely in the bottom-left (bottom: 15px, left: 15px, z-index: 10).
A glassmorphic card with background rgba(13, 17, 28, 0.65), backdrop-filter: blur(20px), border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06), border-radius: 8px, padding: 8px 12px, max-width: 220px, box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), pointer-events: none.
Content:
- Heading (h3): "WebGL Liquid Transition", font-size: 0.75rem, font-weight: 600, margin-bottom: 2px, color: #f3f4f6.
- Paragraph (p): "Move your mouse or swipe across the screen to reveal the underlying image with organic fluid ripples. Adjust settings on the panel to change physics behavior.", font-size: 0.65rem, color: #9ca3af, line-height: 1.3.

2. CONTROLS DASHBOARD
Positioned absolutely in the top-right (top: 15px, right: 15px, z-index: 10).
Layout: A glassmorphic card with width: 200px, max-height: calc(100vh - 30px), background: rgba(13, 17, 28, 0.65), backdrop-filter: blur(20px), border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06), border-radius: 8px, box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), display: flex, flex-direction: column, overflow: hidden.
Minimization feature: When minimized, width is 110px, max-height/height is 32px.
Sections inside Dashboard:
- Header: padding: 8px 10px, border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06), flex layout with space-between. Title (h2): "Simulation Controls" (font-size: 0.75rem, font-weight: 600, linear-gradient text #a5b4fc to #6366f1). Collapse Button: font-size: 0.65rem, padding: 1px 4px, color: #9ca3af, transitions to hover bg rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05).
- Body: padding: 8px, overflow-y: auto, flex: 1.
