  '',
  'https://pub-6e6682d5b928477ab40c1873a1345ec5.r2.dev/videos/1786214866211-bm9bhw4.mp4',
  'System Prompt: Premium Interactive Service Accordion Page
Build a premium, high-fidelity responsive Service Accordion page using pure HTML, Vanilla CSS, and JavaScript. The page has a dark theme (#000000 background) and features custom typography, smooth CSS Grid-based height expansions, dynamic spacer lines, plus-to-minus button rotations, and mouse-over hover triggers.
## GLOBAL STYLES
- **Background**: `#000000` on html, body, and all structural wrappers.
- **Fonts**: 
  - Titles: `''Big Shoulders Display''` (Google Fonts, weight 700, uppercase).
  - Tags & Labels: `''Instrument Sans''` (Google Fonts, weights 500 and 600).
- **Global Reset**: `box-sizing: border-box`, `margin: 0`, `padding: 0`.
- **Base Layout**: Body is centered (`display: flex`, `align-items: center`, `justify-content: center`) with screen-padding: `40px 24px` on desktop/tablet, `32px 16px` on mobile.
## ACCORDION CONTAINER
- Centered layout wrapper with `width: 100%` and `max-width: 1140px`.
