  - Semi-transparent white background (`rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06)`).
  - Advanced glassmorphism border (`1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)`) and soft box shadow.
  - High-intensity blur backplate (`backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(180%)`).
