  'https://pub-6e6682d5b928477ab40c1873a1345ec5.r2.dev/videos/1786215529063-5gka67m.mp4',
  '# Polaroid Scroll Effect Specification Prompt

Build a high-end, scroll-driven photo portfolio landing page replicating the "Polaroid flying camera" effect using HTML5, Vanilla CSS, Vanilla JavaScript, GSAP with ScrollTrigger, and Lenis for smooth scrolling. The page has a dark theme (#000000 background) with the font Inter (Google Fonts, weights 400-600). The page title is "Polaroid Scroll - Framer Replica".

---

## GLOBAL STYLES
*   **Background**: `#000000` (Jet Black) on the outer page wrapper and section bounds.
*   **Font Family**: `''Inter''`, -apple-system, sans-serif.
*   **Reset**: Standard box-sizing `border-box`, margin `0`, padding `0`.
*   **Smooth Scroll**: Lenis smooth scroll active on body.

---

## SECTION ORDER
1.  **HeroSection (Top)**
2.  **MainScrollSection (Scroll Path Area)**
3.  **FooterSection (Bottom)**

---

## 1. HERO SECTION (TOP)
*   **Dimensions**: `70vh` vertical height.
*   **Layout**: Center-aligned flex container.
*   **Elements**:
    *   Centered row showing: Bouncing Arrow (`↓`) + Text "Scroll Down" + Bouncing Arrow (`↓`).
    *   Typography: Font sizes `3rem` (responsive via media queries), font-weight `500`, character spacing `-0.05em`, line-height `1.1em`, colored white `#ffffff`.
    *   Arrow Animation: Bouncing loop using CSS `@keyframes` translating `y` from `0` to `12px` with an ease-in-out alternate cycle lasting `1.5s`.

---

## 2. MAIN SCROLL SECTION
*   **Sticky Viewport**: A sticky block set to `100vh` and `100vw` with `position: sticky; top: 0; overflow: hidden; z-index: 1;`.
*   **Card Holder Box**: Spans `100vw` and `100vh`. Styled with `background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(33, 37, 38) 0%, rgb(14, 14, 14) 100%)`.
*   **Board Scaler Wrapper**: Centered inside the holder box, acts as a scale pivot for responsive scaling across screen widths using CSS scales:
    *   Width <= 1250px: `scale(0.85)`
    *   Width <= 990px: `scale(0.7)`
    *   Width <= 768px: `scale(0.55)`
    *   Width <= 480px: `scale(0.35)`
*   **Polaroid Board**: Absolute-positioned canvas inside the board-scaler.
    *   **Dimensions**: `3205px` width by `2300px` height.
    *   **Pivot/Center Point**: Positioned at `left: 50%; top: 50%` and pre-translated with `translate(-50%, -23%)` to align the first Polaroid card exactly in the viewport center at scroll start.
*   **Polaroid Cards**: 6 physical-styled cards placed absolutely on the board at the following positions:
    *   **Card 1**: `left: 50%; top: 23%; transform: rotate(0deg)`
    *   **Card 2**: `left: 70%; top: 33%; transform: rotate(25deg)`
    *   **Card 3**: `left: 89%; top: 45%; transform: rotate(12deg)`
    *   **Card 4**: `left: 42%; top: 58%; transform: rotate(23deg)`
    *   **Card 5**: `left: 61%; top: 67%; transform: rotate(15deg)`
    *   **Card 6**: `left: 79%; top: 78%; transform: rotate(23deg)`
*   **Card Design & Styling**:
    *   Outer dimensions: `445px` width by `610px` height.
    *   Background: `rgb(237, 237, 237)` (off-white cardboard texture).
    *   Padding: `30px 30px 120px 30px` (narrow top/sides border, thick classic bottom margin).
    *   Shadow: Solid physical drop-shadow `0px 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4)`.
    *   Image Frame: Inner wrapper size `385px` x `460px`, rounded corners `2px`, image content set to `object-fit: cover` with saturation filter `saturate(0.74)`.
    *   Texture Overlay: Tiled grain image overlay inside each card:
        *   URL: `https://framerusercontent.com/images/6mcf62RlDfRfU61Yg5vb2pefpi4.png?width=256&height=256`
        *   Blending: `mix-blend-mode: screen`, opacity `0.28`, `z-index: 2` overlaying the image.
*   **Card Image Assets**:
    1.  `https://framerusercontent.com/images/VOiDIvkkAmPkxFWMl9Ce8l5GlI.png?width=482&height=640`
    2.  `https://framerusercontent.com/images/7C3SzoyKMzl4gzr2hqKEhD1ciig.png?width=482&height=640`
    3.  `https://framerusercontent.com/images/l26YTzFZWY7F05O83w0S1CARc.png?width=482&height=640`
    4.  `https://framerusercontent.com/images/CaM8unNUSMx3Die6IUr8Ax9WHEQ.png?width=960&height=1200`
    5.  `https://framerusercontent.com/images/wtjWtgYnuHNdos4PCg7RDAEcYc.png?width=904&height=1200`
    6.  `https://framerusercontent.com/images/IidhdSMs6KG023K8nWbvaUorWzc.png?width=497&height=640`

---

## 3. SCROLL TRIGGERS & PATH TRANSFORMS
*   **Triggers Container**: Placed in normal flow following the sticky viewport.
*   **Scroll Triggers**: 5 separate triggers stacked vertically, each measuring `height: 400px` to create a total animation scroll-track length of `2000px`.
*   **Flight Path Timeline**: Mapped to the scroll progress of the triggers container from `top bottom` (top of triggers hits bottom of screen) to `bottom bottom` (bottom of triggers hits bottom of screen) using GSAP''s ScrollTrigger with a `scrub: 1.5` lag setting for smooth organic interpolation.
*   **Timeline Target Points** (Applied to `.polaroid-board` offset values):
    *   **Stage 0 (Start)**: `x: 0, y: 0, scale: 1, rotation: 0` (Card 1 centered)
    *   **Stage 1**: `x: -390, y: -80, scale: 0.9, rotation: -25` (Card 2 centered)
    *   **Stage 2**: `x: -1130, y: -270, scale: 1, rotation: -12` (Card 3 centered)
    *   **Stage 3**: `x: -1070, y: -910, scale: 1, rotation: -21` (Card 4 centered)
    *   **Stage 4**: `x: -420, y: -897, scale: 0.9, rotation: -16` (Card 5 centered)
    *   **Stage 5**: `x: 160, y: -914, scale: 1, rotation: -21` (Card 6 centered)

---

## 4. FOOTER SECTION (BOTTOM)
*   **Dimensions**: `100vh` vertical height.
*   **Layout**: Center-aligned flex container.
*   **Elements**:
    *   Title: "THE END", size `3rem`, font-weight `500`, tracking `-0.05em`.
    *   Subtitle: "These are some examples - You can fully customize/design to your needs.", size `1.1rem`, color `#a3a3a3`, centered, max-width `600px`.',
