  '# Prompt: Accordion Images Pro Hover Effect

Build a cinematic project list landing page called **"Accordion Images Pro"** featuring a full-screen background image reveal on hover, zoom-out animation, mouse parallax, and directional typographic contrast highlight sweeps. Use vanilla HTML5, vanilla CSS3, vanilla ES6 JavaScript, and Vite as the local development server. The page has a default dark theme background (`#000000`) and uses the font **"Instrument Sans"** (Google Fonts, weights 400, 500, and 700).

---

## GLOBAL STYLES
- **Background**: `#000000` (or variable `--bg-color`) on `body`
- **Text Color**: `#f8f5f2` (cream white, or variable `--text-color`)
- **Highlight Color**: `#f8f5f2` (cream white, or variable `--highlight-color`)
- **Font Family**: `''Instrument Sans'', sans-serif`
- **Global Reset**: `box-sizing: border-box`, reset all margins and paddings to 0. Hide viewport overflow scrollbars on the body element (`overflow: hidden`).
- **Typography settings**: Custom variables for `--font-size: 28px` and `--uppercase: uppercase`.

---

## SECTION ORDER
1. **Header Navigation**
2. **Accordion Section**
3. **Footer**

---

## 1. BACKGROUND PARALLAX LAYER
A background image viewer container absolute-positioned behind all page elements:
- **Sizing**: Set to cover the entire viewport plus an extra bleed offset on all edges (`top/bottom/left/right` set to `calc(-2 * var(--parallax-offset))`, default `--parallax-offset` is `14px`) to allow mouse translation without showing white borders.
- **Inner Image Wrapper**: Set to `100%` width and height, handling translation offsets via JavaScript.
- **Image Element**: Set to fill the screen (`object-fit: cover`).
  - Default styles: `scale(1.2)` and `opacity: 0`.
  - Transition behavior: `transition: transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94), opacity 0.5s ease`.
  - On hover of an accordion row: the image source changes to that item''s image URL, fades in to `opacity: 1`, and zoom-animates down from `scale(1.2)` to `scale(1.0)`.
  - When the mouse leaves the entire accordion list wrapper: the image fades out to `opacity: 0` with a `0.5s ease` transition.

---

## 2. HEADER NAVIGATION
Minimal horizontal bar overlay:
- **Layout**: Flexbox with `justify-content: space-between`, `align-items: center`, padding `2rem 0`, pointer-events enabled.
- **Logo**: Text `"ACCORDION IMAGES PRO"`, `font-size: 1rem`, `font-weight: 700`, uppercase, letter-spacing `0.1em`.
- **Links**: Nav links `"PORTFOLIO"`, `"STUDIO"`, `"ABOUT"`. Text is `font-size: 0.8rem`, `font-weight: 600`, opacity `0.7` with hover transition to `opacity: 1`.
- **Contrast Blending**: Uses `mix-blend-mode: exclusion` to remain readable and flip contrast colors over background images.

---

## 3. ACCORDION SECTION
Centered container holding the cinematic hover list:
- **Dimensions**: Max-width `1200px`, centered horizontally.
- **Staggered Entry**: On load, rows slide up (`translateY(20px) -> translateY(0)`) and fade in (`opacity: 0 -> 1`) with a staggered delay of `index * 70ms + 80ms`.
- **Accordion Row**:
  - Horizontal flexbox layout with `justify-content: space-between` and `align-items: center`, cursor pointer, overflow hidden, padding `1.5rem 1.5rem` (expands to `1.5rem 2rem` on hover).
  - Bottom border: `1px solid rgba(248, 245, 242, 0.12)`.
  - Typography: Contains a Title and a Year. Both span elements must have `font-size: var(--font-size)`, `font-weight: 700`, letter-spacing `-0.03em`, text-transform `var(--uppercase)`, `mix-blend-mode: exclusion` and `z-index: 2` so that text color flips dynamically to dark when a white sweep bar passes beneath them.
- **Sweep Highlight Element**: An absolute-positioned element `.row-highlight` with background-color `var(--highlight-color)` and `z-index: 1`.
  - Directional transitions are controlled by changing classes on the list parent:
    - **`top-down`**: Height transitions `0%` to `100%` from top edge.
    - **`bottom-up`**: Height transitions `0%` to `100%` from bottom edge.
    - **`left-right`**: Width transitions `0%` to `100%` from left edge.
    - **`right-left`**: Width transitions `0%` to `100%` from right edge.
  - Transition timing curves: Fast sweep in (`0.2s`) and slow retreat on leave (`0.8s`), using cubic-bezier curve `cubic-bezier(0.445, 0.05, 0.55, 0.95)`.

---

## 4. FOOTER
Horizontal summary overlay at the bottom:
- **Layout**: Flexbox with `justify-content: space-between`, `align-items: center`, padding `2rem 0`, `mix-blend-mode: exclusion`, `opacity: 0.5`, `font-size: 0.7rem`, `font-weight: 500`.
- **Left Content**: `© 2026 AHMET LOCA & DEEPMIND PAIR`.
- **Middle Content**: `MADE WITH PURE JS, CSS & EXCLUSION BLENDING`.
- **Right Content**: Pulse-animated tip text `HOVER ANY ROW TO REVEAL`.

---

## PROJECT ITEM DATA
The landing page includes the following 6 showcase projects with exact public CDN image URLs:

1. **Title**: `Quiet House` | **Year**: `2026` | **Image**: `https://framerusercontent.com/images/s9l2avmz0ouWQb47bexsHny4e9Y.webp`
2. **Title**: `Veil` | **Year**: `2026` | **Image**: `https://framerusercontent.com/images/zGvAHyuKa93QJHozGrqt32oDdWg.webp`
3. **Title**: `Kitchen Studies` | **Year**: `2026` | **Image**: `https://framerusercontent.com/images/fzJMEh57n9IbStcFFu91Z1Zu4xk.webp`
4. **Title**: `Terra` | **Year**: `2026` | **Image**: `https://framerusercontent.com/images/ymzkV7FNI46taBflpHBUDKqTc.webp`
5. **Title**: `Low Light` | **Year**: `2025` | **Image**: `https://framerusercontent.com/images/oY4SsvtScmLdS1fFZCjTPMWNQ8.webp`
6. **Title**: `Threshold` | **Year**: `2025` | **Image**: `https://framerusercontent.com/images/1gFW4nsrOIePekZNhrmtPFVlY.webp`

