  '# Recreation Prompt: Editorial Parallax Story (THE GREEN)

Build an editorial scrollytelling parallax landing page for "THE GREEN" using HTML, Vanilla CSS, JavaScript (ES6+), GSAP (with ScrollTrigger), and Lenis (for smooth scrolling). The page has a clean, high-contrast light theme with the font **Instrument Sans** (Google Fonts, weights 500-600) and a primary text color of dark red-black (`rgb(36, 0, 8)`). The page title is "THE GREEN -- Built to be bold".

---

## GLOBAL STYLES
- **Background**: `#FFFFFF` (pure white) on html, body, and all content wrappers.
- **Text Color**: `rgb(36, 0, 8)` (dark blackish-red) for all paragraph content.
- **Font Family**: `''Instrument Sans''`, sans-serif.
- **Global Reset**: `box-sizing: border-box`, `margin: 0`, `padding: 0`.
- **Main Wrapper**: Has `overflowX: clip` and `width: 100%` to prevent side-scrolling bugs.
- **Smooth Scroll**: Powered by **Lenis** with a smooth deceleration curve.

---

## SECTION STRUCTURE
The page consists of a single tall scrolling container that behaves as the scrollytelling track.

### 1. Editorial Parallax Section
- **Height**: 
  - Desktop (1200px+): `min-height: 210vh`
  - Tablet (768px-1199.98px): `min-height: 240vh`
  - Mobile (<768px): `min-height: 250vh`
- **Positioning**: `position: relative`, `overflow: clip`, `background: #FFFFFF`.

---

## CORE FEATURES & IMPLEMENTATION DETAILS

### 1. Scattered Typography Layout
Inside the section is a relative `.text-container` layer holding 6 paragraphs.
- **Padding**:
  - Desktop/Tablet: `padding: clamp(140px, 20vh, 260px) 4vw clamp(200px, 30vh, 420px) 4vw; gap: clamp(80px, 12vh, 180px);`
  - Mobile: `padding: 100px 4vw 200px 4vw; gap: 60px;`
- **Typography Sizing & Weights**:
  - Font size:
    - Desktop: `clamp(62px, 5.3vw, 102px)`
    - Tablet: `clamp(48px, 7vw, 76px)`
    - Mobile: `clamp(39px, 11.5vw, 64px)`
  - Styles: `font-weight: 600`, `line-height: 0.95em`, `letter-spacing: -0.035em`.
- **Paragraph Positioning**:
  - **Paragraph 1 (Intro)**: `"This is THE GREEN. Built to be bold."`
    - Align: Center. Text-align: Center. Max-width: `84vw`. Desktop offset: translate X by `3vw`.
  - **Paragraph 2 (Historical)**: `"A historic landmark of character and color that has defined Chicago''s skyline since"`
    - Align: Left. Text-align: Left. Max-width: `96vw`.
  - **Paragraph 3 (Date)**: `"1972."`
    - Align: Left. Text-align: Left.
  - **Paragraph 4 (Business)**: `"Today, it meets the needs of modern business, offering over a million square feet of workspace across 44 floors,"`
    - Align: Left. Text-align: Left. Max-width: `80vw` (desktop/tablet), `90vw` (mobile). Margin-left: `16vw` (desktop), `8vw` (tablet), `4vw` (mobile).
  - **Paragraph 5 (Amenities)**: `"complemented by outstanding amenities, including a fitness and wellness center, auditorium and conference spaces, childcare services, and East Loop''s most comprehensive dining experience: Hayden Hall."`
    - Align: Left. Text-align: Left. Max-width: `92vw` (desktop/tablet), `100vw` (mobile). Margin-left: `2vw` (desktop/tablet), `0vw` (mobile).
  - **Paragraph 6 (Closing)**: `"Discover why today''s trailblazers work, play and pioneer in a building like no other in one of the most distinctive districts in Chicago."`
    - Align: Left. Text-align: Left. Max-width: `68vw` (desktop), `76vw` (tablet), `90vw` (mobile). Margin-left: `28vw` (desktop), `14vw` (tablet), `6vw` (mobile).

---

### 2. Scroll Reveal Typography Animation
- **Trigger Timing**: As each paragraph scrolls through the viewport, its words highlight one-by-one.
- **Scroll Bounds**: Animation starts when the top of the paragraph hits `80%` of the viewport height and ends when the bottom of the paragraph reaches `40%` of the viewport height.
- **Color Transition**:
  - Initial word color: `rgba(51, 255, 0, 0.18)` (a faint green reveal highlight)
  - Final word color: `rgb(36, 0, 8)` (solid dark blackish-red)
- **Technical setup**: Dynamically wrap every word of the paragraph in a span with the class `.reveal-word`. Use a staggered ScrollTrigger tween bound to the paragraph''s scroll range.

---

### 3. Floating Parallax Images
Four absolute positioned images float behind or around the text in a container `.floating-images-container` (`zIndex: 4`). Their Y position, X drift, scale, rotation, and opacity are animated using GSAP ScrollTrigger bound to the scroll progress of the entire `.editorial-section` (`start: ''top bottom''`, `end: ''bottom top''`).

#### Public Image CDN Links
- Image 1: `https://framerusercontent.com/images/6US3Sio4BGUFx6wNpuh47i1bC4U.jpg` (Building facade detail)
- Image 2: `https://framerusercontent.com/images/g4P1OYe5alQyzXVkQnsXUMn4AMQ.jpg` (Interior workspace)
- Image 3: `https://framerusercontent.com/images/P3V32GlG1ok8bJ6esPKr73ow9A.jpg` (Architecture detail)
- Image 4: `https://framerusercontent.com/images/6Dj7MjHu5a5Ub1j37OnTjAdGRT4.png` (Copper object)

#### Image Layout & Animation Constants
All animations scrub linearly with scroll progress (`0.0` to `1.0` of the master section scroll trigger).
The Y translation multiplier is `globalParallaxMultiplier = 1.65`.

1. **Image 1** (`#img-1`):
   - **Properties**: Aspect ratio `0.66`, `zIndex: 5`. Width: `15vw` (desktop), `20vw` (tablet), `32vw` (mobile). Left: `50%` (desktop), `48%` (tablet), `40%` (mobile). Top: `15%`.
   - **Animation Range**: Starts at `0.1` and ends at `0.38` of progress.
   - **Motion**: Translate Y goes from `+280.5px` to `-280.5px` (parallax factor `170px * 1.65`). Scale goes from `0.97` to `1.0`. X remains `0`.
   - **Opacity**: Fades in from `0` to `1` over the first 35% of the scroll range (`duration: 0.098`), stays fully visible, and then fades out to `0` over the last 35% of the range.

2. **Image 2** (`#img-2`):
   - **Properties**: Aspect ratio `1.0`, `zIndex: 7`. Width: `11vw` (desktop), `16vw` (tablet), `27vw` (mobile). Left: `80%` (desktop), `74%` (tablet), `62%` (mobile). Top: `36%`.
   - **Animation Range**: Starts at `0.27` and ends at `0.55` of progress.
   - **Motion**: Translate Y goes from `+264px` to `-264px` (parallax factor `160px * 1.65`). Drift X goes from `0` to `-50px`. Scale goes from `0.98` to `1.02`.
   - **Opacity**: Fades in over the first 35% of the range, stays fully visible, and fades out over the last 35% of the range.

3. **Image 3** (`#img-3`):
   - **Properties**: Aspect ratio `0.7`, `zIndex: 6`. Width: `12vw` (desktop), `17vw` (tablet), `29vw` (mobile). Left: `32%` (desktop), `30%` (tablet), `12%` (mobile). Top: `50%`.
   - **Animation Range**: Starts at `0.4` and ends at `0.69` of progress.
   - **Motion**: Translate Y goes from `+346.5px` to `-346.5px` (parallax factor `210px * 1.65`). Drift X goes from `0` to `+24px`. Scale goes from `0.98` to `1.01`. Rotation goes from `-3deg` to `+2deg`.
   - **Opacity**: Fades in over the first 35% of the range, stays fully visible, and fades out over the last 35% of the range.

4. **Image 4** (`#img-4`):
   - **Properties**: Aspect ratio `0.9`, `zIndex: 8`. Width: `11vw` (desktop), `16vw` (tablet), hidden entirely on mobile (`display: none`). Left: `55%` (desktop), `54%` (tablet). Top: `73%`.
   - **Animation Range**: Starts at `0.61` and ends at `0.91` of progress.
   - **Motion**: Translate Y goes from `+198px` to `-198px` (parallax factor `120px * 1.65`). Drift X goes from `0` to `-20px`. Scale goes from `0.96` to `1.03`.
   - **Opacity**: Fades in over the first 35% of the range, stays fully visible, and fades out over the last 35% of the range.

---

## KEY DEPENDENCIES
- **gsap** (with **ScrollTrigger** plugin)
- **lenis** (for inertial smooth scroll)
- **Instrument Sans** (Google Fonts weight 500, 600)

---

## RESPONSIVE BREAKPOINTS
All elements scale fluidly via `clamp()` and view-width (`vw`) values. It adapts across:
- **Mobile** (`< 768px`): Text shrinks, gaps reduce, margins shift closer to center, Image 4 is completely hidden, and remaining images expand in width to preserve visibility.
- **Tablet** (`768px` to `1199.98px`): Intermediate grid width columns and image positioning.
- **Desktop** (`1200px`+): Full layout with scattered text offsets and maximum image parallax strengths.',
