  '# Showcase Scroll - Design and Interaction Specification

Build an interactive Showcase Scroll gallery landing page using HTML, Vanilla CSS, and Vanilla JavaScript. The page has a clean, light-mode background (#ebebeb) with typography driven by Google Fonts: Lato (weights 400, 700) and Inter (weight 500). The page title is "Showcase Scroll - Framer Component".

## Global Styles
- **Background**: `#ebebeb` on the base body and non-carousel wrappers.
- **Font families**: `''Lato'', sans-serif` for primary copy and cards; `''Inter'', sans-serif` for headlines and indicator labels.
- **Global Reset**: `box-sizing: border-box`, `margin: 0`, `padding: 0`, with hardware accelerated font smoothing.
- **Linear Pastels Gradient Background**: The horizontal slider container has a custom shifting background gradient defined as `linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(240, 240, 240) 0%, rgba(247, 247, 247, 0.83) 15.65%, rgba(223, 236, 242, 0.87) 21%, rgba(242, 238, 225, 0.9) 41%, rgba(250, 237, 244, 0.93) 58.76%, rgba(241, 235, 250, 0.96) 74.94%, rgb(240, 240, 240) 100%)`.

## Section Order
1. **TopSection** (Intro Screen)
2. **ShowcaseScrollSection** (Sticky Horizontal Carousel)
3. **EndSection** (Outro Screen)

---

## 1. Top Section
- **Layout**: Full-screen landing area with `90vh` height and `#dedede` background color. Uses a flex-column layout to center contents.
- **Content**:
  - Text `"Scroll Down"` in `Inter` font, `3rem` (`48px`) size, weight 500, letter-spacing `-0.05em`, color `rgb(8, 8, 8)`.
  - Bouncing Arrow icon `"↓"` (`3rem`) positioned below the text.
  - **Animation**: The arrow loops a smooth vertical bounce animation shifting `12px` up and down using a `1.5s` infinite ease-in-out cycle.

---

## 2. Showcase Scroll Section
- **Layout**: Serves as a vertical scrolling track with `300vh` height, wrapping a `100vh` sticky container (`position: sticky; top: 0; overflow: hidden;`).
- **Horizontal Track**: Inside the sticky container, a flex row (`display: flex; flex-wrap: nowrap; align-items: center; height: 100vh;`) holds the slides.
  - **Margins & Spacing**: Left padding `15vw` (at start) and right padding `10vw` (at end) to prevent slides from sitting flush with screen edges. Gap between slide items is `120px` (desktop) and `80px` (tablet).
  - **Dynamic Background**: The linear pastels gradient is applied directly to the track background so that as the track translates horizontally, the colors slide smoothly under the cards.
- **Scroll Physics & Lerping**:
  - On scroll, the horizontal translation `translateX` moves the track from `0` to `-(trackWidth - windowWidth)`.
  - Uses linear interpolation (lerp factor `0.08`) updated via `requestAnimationFrame` to convert standard scroll increments into a smooth, inertia-based gliding motion.
- **Vertical Slide-up Card Reveals**:
  - Cards 1, 2, 3, 4, and the Outro text slide start hidden with `opacity: 0` and `transform: translateY(200px)`.
  - Uses an `IntersectionObserver` that triggers when the card enters the viewport horizontally (15% threshold), adding an `.in-view` class to smoothly transition them to `opacity: 1` and `translateY(0)` over `1.1s` using a springy `cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)` easing.

### Slides List & Details (with original CDN images):

1. **Slide 1 - Intro Slide**:
   - Typography-only text block. Width `540px`.
   - Title: `"Featured Work and Projects"`, size `60px`, weight 400, color `rgb(46, 46, 46)`, line-height `1.05em`, letter-spacing `-0.03em`.
   - Subtitle: `"Explore all our work and discover high-performing websites and digital experiences."`, size `20px`, color `rgb(8, 8, 8)`, line-height `1.5em`, max-width `450px`.

2. **Slide 2 - Card 1 (Saleint)**:
   - Width: `538px`, height: `446.5px`. Card is a div container (`div.card`) with hover cursor actions.
   - Image: `https://framerusercontent.com/images/3vzYvsggkwGUgMF9x7SzsbQixPo.webp`
   - Image Wrapper: `375px` height, `12px` border-radius, `overflow: hidden`, box-shadow `0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.04)`.
   - Title: `"Saleint"`, Lato bold, size `22px`, color `rgb(8, 8, 8)`.
   - Description: `"Creative Studio & Agency Template"`, Lato regular, size `15px`, color `rgb(110, 110, 110)`.
   - Arrow Circle: Interactive hover arrow in the bottom row (details below).

3. **Slide 3 - Card 2 (Blocks)**:
   - Width: `538px`, height: `446.5px`. Card is a div container (`div.card`).
   - Image: `https://framerusercontent.com/images/xeEYWgi0SIqdlrOSdEftoT5lgYY.webp`
   - Title: `"Blocks"`, Description: `"SaaS Framer Template"`. All layout parameters match Card 1.

4. **Slide 4 - Card 3 (Elements)**:
   - Width: `538px`, height: `446.5px`. Card is a div container (`div.card`).
   - Image: `https://framerusercontent.com/images/DTFCAlRDP3icbyCL2kdgYX7ZA.png`
   - Title: `"Elements"`, Description: `"AI Framer Website"`. All layout parameters match Card 1.

5. **Slide 5 - Card 4 (ECOM)**:
