  '# Interactive 3D Rope Gallery Landing Page Specification

This document provides a highly detailed, low-level technical specification and prompt for building the **Astro 3D Hanging Rope Gallery Landing Page**. It covers all design system variables, DOM structures, Three.js coordinates, 1D physical wave simulations, driven pendulum dynamics, procedural card painting, and interaction configurations.

---

## 1. Application Overview & Goal
Build a landing page for **"Astro — Safe web for kids to learn and grow"**. The application features a lightweight overlay of text/buttons over an interactive 3D WebGL stage where a realistic rope hangs across the screen. From this rope, multiple educational card topics are suspended by green plastic clothes-pins (clips). The user can drag, scroll, or use keyboard arrows to slide the cards infinitely across the screen, exciting wave ripples on the rope, triggering pendulum sways, and experiencing vertical bounces on the cards.

---

## 2. Design System & CSS Styles
All sizing, color values, typography, and styling must adhere to the following tokens.

### A. Colors & Variables
*   `--ink`: `#0b0b0b` (Primary text & logo)
*   `--ink-2`: `#2a2a2a` (Secondary elements)
*   `--muted`: `#6e6e6e` (Standard muted labels)
*   `--muted-2`: `#8a8a8a` (Drags hints and help text)
*   `--green`: `#22c24c` (Primary green gradient start)
*   `--green-deep`: `#17a93e` (Primary green gradient end)
*   `--green-text`: `#1fc24a` (Accent highlighted text)
*   `--paper`: `#ffffff` (Card background & badge bases)
*   `--hairline`: `rgba(11, 11, 11, 0.075)` (Subtle borders)
*   `Background Color`: `#faf8f4`
*   `Background Gradients`: Four layered fixed radial gradients:
    1.  `radial-gradient(58% 48% at 10% 104%, rgba(240, 203, 152, 0.8), rgba(240, 203, 152, 0) 70%)`
    2.  `radial-gradient(52% 44% at 90% 102%, rgba(243, 213, 164, 0.85), rgba(243, 213, 164, 0) 70%)`
    3.  `radial-gradient(46% 38% at 63% 96%, rgba(203, 229, 148, 0.72), rgba(203, 229, 148, 0) 72%)`
    4.  `radial-gradient(64% 52% at 50% -6%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 64%)`

### B. Typography & Font Families
*   **Primary Font**: `''Outfit'', sans-serif` (weights 300, 400, 500, 600, 700) for standard labels, subtext, nav links, and card descriptions.
*   **Display Font**: `''Anton'', Impact, sans-serif` (weight 400) for the main branding logo and the primary Hero `h1` heading.

### C. Fluid Responsive Type Scale
*   `--fs-nav`: `clamp(13px, 1.25vw, 15.5px)`
*   `--fs-badge`: `clamp(12px, 1.13vw, 13.5px)`
*   `--fs-h1`: `clamp(40px, 7.8vw, 96px)`
*   `--fs-sub`: `clamp(14.5px, 1.55vw, 19px)`
*   `--fs-cta`: `clamp(15px, 1.42vw, 17.5px)`
*   `--pad-x`: `clamp(18px, 3.3vw, 44px)`
*   `--nav-y`: `clamp(18px, 2.2vw, 30px)`

### D. Box Shadows
*   `--sh-badge`: `0 1px 2px rgba(11, 11, 11, 0.04), 0 6px 18px rgba(11, 11, 11, 0.05)`
*   `--sh-btn-sm`: `0 4px 14px rgba(34, 194, 76, 0.3), 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35) inset`
*   `--sh-btn-lg`: `0 10px 30px rgba(34, 194, 76, 0.34), 0 2px 6px rgba(34, 194, 76, 0.22), 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4) inset`

---

## 3. DOM Structure & Responsive Overlays
The page layout consists of a background 3D canvas stage covered by a layout page wrapper. 

### A. Main Canvas Stage
An absolute HTML `<canvas id="stage">` covers the viewport. 
*   **Dimensions**: Full window width (`100%`), height calculated dynamically to match the bounds of the cards.
*   **Layering**: Positioned behind the text elements (`z-index: 0`) and has `pointer-events: none` to let mouse gestures flow through.

### B. Interactive Hit Zone
An absolute overlay `div#ropeHit` is positioned inside the `#ropeZone`.
*   **Interaction Layer**: Receives pointer inputs (`pointer-events: auto`), mouse wheel scrolls, and keyboard focus.
*   **Aesthetics**: Normal cursor is `grab`; active dragging cursor changes to `grabbing`. Focused state shows a green outline: `inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(34, 194, 76, 0.65)` with `border-radius: 14px`.

### C. Flat Page Interface (`.page` Wrapper)
Arranged in a vertical flexbox layout (`flex-direction: column`, `min-height: 100svh`, `pointer-events: none` so underlying canvas hit-testing works). All links, buttons, and input areas restore pointer events using `pointer-events: auto`.

1.  **Navigation Bar (`.nav`)**:
