  - *Fanning Inertia*: Dragging/spinning at high velocity flings the covers. Positive velocity peels the front cover wide open; negative velocity flings the back cover open, fanning open the rear pages.

3. PROCEDURAL COVER AND MATERIAL RENDERING
Each book uses complex canvas-drawn procedural cover layouts (falling back to CORS-compliant network cover images if available):
