5. Central product bag scales and fades: `scale: 0.9`, `opacity: 0`, duration `1.1`s.
6. Right-side features enter from the right: `x: 46`, `opacity: 0`, duration `0.8`s, staggered by `0.1`s.
7. Flavor cards rise up: `y: 70`, `opacity: 0`, duration `0.9`s, staggered by `0.08`s.

