GLOBAL STYLES
Background: Dynamic background color stored in CSS variable `--scene-bg`, applied to body.
Font family: `--font-inter` (system fallbacks: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif), applied to body.
Global reset: Box-sizing `border-box` on all elements. Document scroll is locked (`overflow: hidden; height: 100%;` on body) whenever the showroom is open to prevent layout shifts.
