  '# Prompt: Build MODKEYS — Interactive 3D Keyboard Configurator

Build a highly polished, interactive 3D Keyboard Configurator web application called **MODKEYS** using HTML5, CSS3, Vanilla JavaScript, Three.js (r128), and GSAP (3.12.5). The application must feature real-time 3D board rendering, procedural keycap modeling, interactive custom key editing, automatic color palette extraction from uploaded keyboard photos (including a 4-point projective warp/homography mapping tool), and synthesized switch click sounds using the Web Audio API.

---

## 1. GLOBAL STYLES & INTERFACE THEMES

- **Font Family**: Primary font is `"Inter"`, with fallbacks `"SF Pro Display"`, `-apple-system`, `"Segoe UI"`, `Roboto`, `Arial`, and `sans-serif`. Monospace font is `"Inter"`, `"SF Pro Display"` or system monospaces.
