## 4. LAYOUT COMPONENTS

### A. Concentric Background (`components/Background/ConcentricBackground.tsx`)
This component renders the dynamic, fluid multi-layered radial background and concentric SVG circles.
- **HTML Layout**:
  - Main container is absolute, pointer-events-none, covers the screen (`inset-0`), has overflow-hidden and `rounded-[var(--radius-32)]`.
  - Layer 1 (Base Dynamic Gradient): `absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_var(--light-x)_var(--light-y),var(--stage-c4)_0%,var(--stage-c2)_28%,var(--stage-c1)_55%,var(--stage-c3)_100%)]`.
  - Layer 2 (Lighting Highlights): `absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_52%_47%,rgb(255_255_255_/_0.28)_0%,transparent_31%),radial-gradient(circle_at_8%_10%,rgb(255_255_255_/_0.16)_0%,transparent_24%),linear-gradient(135deg,transparent_0%,rgb(255_255_255_/_0.1)_48%,transparent_68%)]`.
  - Layer 3 (Vignette): `absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_50%,transparent_0%,transparent_61%,rgb(100_26_0_/_0.08)_100%)]`.
  - Concentric SVG Rings Element:
    - Classes: `absolute -inset-[12%] h-[124%] w-[124%]`.
    - `viewBox="0 0 1800 1100"`.
    - Renders 6 concentric SVG `<circle>` tags. Centered at `cx="960"`, `cy="545"`, with radii: `[190, 315, 440, 565, 690, 815]`.
    - Circles have `fill="none"`, `stroke="rgb(var(--ring-color) / var(--ring-opacity))"`.
    - Stroke widths: Inner two circles (index 0 and 1) have `strokeWidth={104}`, outer four circles have `strokeWidth={118}`.
    - Attribute selector tag `data-bg-ring` is added to all circles.
- **GSAP Floating Animation**:
  - Within a GSAP context, animate the SVG element rotation to simulate a floating background:
    - Rotate: `3.5`
    - Transform Origin: `"54% 50%"`
    - Duration: `18s`
    - Repeat: `-1` (infinite)
    - Yoyo: `true` (reverses back and forth)
    - Ease: `"sine.inOut"`

