  '# Interactive Starbucks Drink Experience Page Prompt

Build an interactive, high-fidelity Starbucks drink landing page experience using React, Next.js (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, GSAP (GreenSock Animation Platform), Zustand, and Lucide React. The page features a premium card-style frame, fluid custom cursor/mouse-glow effects, responsive styling, and custom spring-loaded transitions when switching between beverages.

