## 1. Global Setup, Styling & Tokens

### Design System & CSS Variables
Define a theme configuration using standard Tailwind styling paired with CSS variables on the root/parent scope.
*   **Fonts:** `Inter` (sans-serif) for primary content, set as the default text font.
*   **Easing Curves:** Premium cubic-bezier curve for micro-interactions: `cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1)` (referred to as `--ease-premium`).
*   **Transitions:** Standardized transition speeds:
    *   Fast: `0.2s`
    *   Base/Medium: `0.35s`
    *   Smooth: `0.6s`
    *   Cinematic: `0.8s`
    *   Idle: `1.2s`
*   **Shadows:**
    *   Soft: `0 18px 60px rgb(30 25 18 / 0.08)`
    *   Medium: `0 18px 46px rgb(25 22 18 / 0.16)`
    *   Hero Drink: `0 30px 65px rgb(8 82 55 / 0.34)`
    *   Floating Bean: `0 18px 30px rgb(88 40 16 / 0.28)`
    *   Drink Card: `0 22px 42px rgb(24 28 24 / 0.14)`
*   **Standard Colors:**
    *   Cream background base: `#f7efe1`
    *   Ink text base: `#17191c`
    *   Muted gray: `#5c6366`
    *   Surface: `#fffdf8`

### Global CSS & Document Reset
*   Apply `box-sizing: border-box` globally.
*   Prevent vertical stretching on HTML by enforcing `min-width: 320px` and styling a fallback body layout.
*   Apply a base radial background on the document `html` selector:
    *   Layer 1: `radial-gradient(circle at 20% 8%, rgb(255 255 255 / 0.85), transparent 34%)`
    *   Layer 2: `radial-gradient(circle at 78% 84%, rgb(20 120 78 / 0.12), transparent 30%)`
    *   Layer 3: `linear-gradient(135deg, #f2eadc, #fff9ee 45%, #efe4d2)`

