  '# Wearly — AI Virtual Try-On Platform Specification

Build a high-fidelity virtual try-on and fit-aware catalog web application called "Wearly" using React, TypeScript, Next.js, and CSS (Tailwind CSS or Vanilla CSS variables). The application allows users to build a detailed body profile, browse a clothing catalog, check deterministic garment fit breakdowns, and generate realistic three-view AI virtual try-ons.

